	 ('18489565','76561198116160479','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,8,'[h1]Basically a Poker Addiction Promotion simulator.[/h1]

As much as losing virtual money has torn my soul apart, I regret parting ways with my precious, hard-earned 5 bucks. The opponents are hard to beat, with no option of selecting the AI difficulty. Aaaand there goes another 20 dollars so you can use those ''snazzy'' in-game items you just won for [i]Borderlands 2[/i].

Moreover, the interaction between characters in this game is entertaining to watch. Recommended for any fan of [b]Portal 2[/b] and GlaDOS''s stark, narcissistic sense of humour. You can also buy your opponents drinks to get them drunk.

10/10 would gamble again'),
