	 ('75228516','76561198319557946','1197770','20251230',6,1,0,0,10,'Since I''m planning to leave Steam soon and Steam bans reviews for no apparent reason, I won''t bother writing a comprehensive review so here''s a quick summary.

This is an erotic adventure game. ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°) The game world is extremely empty and basically you''ll be moving from area to area in a linear fashion and encounter NPCs, sexy interactions and enemies along the way. The combat is dull, repetitive and entirely dependent on RNG. Thankfully, there''s a One Hit Kill mode in the settings which allows you to easily bypass all combat which is the most redundant and annoying part of the game. The sex scenes require simple interaction which is unfortunately quite tedious as well. 

