	 ('43694414','76561198062699260','234710','20251230',2,0,0,0,4,'I decided to update this review as the one I wrote earlier was incredibly salty.
Despite the fact that I''ve chilled out, I still have trouble recommending this game.

If you''re interested to buy this for purely the poker aspect then I can''t recommend this game as it can feel really cheap with the wins and loses, it feels almost as if the game is cheating you in a way? I noticed a lot of people complaining about that problem in forums and I can definitely confirm that it''s a thing.

Because of this, I personally prefer the first Poker Night(Gameplay wise only) as it felt fairer (But the characters weren''t as fun to listen to in the first game).

Now if you''re interested in this game because you want the achievement items (which are admittedly pretty awesome), or you want to hear the banter in this fun lil crossover, then I would definitely be able to recommend you the game.

Keep in mind that the Borderland items tend to not be given to people despite winning them if this happens to you just contact Gearbox Software Support (I had to do this and I received my missing items in less than a week :D)'),
