	 ('199495729','76561198118379085','2427430','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'I never got to play the S.T.A.L.K.E.R. games. I am an only recently-reformed console-peasant. I still want/need to use a controller. Now, the enhanced series has that as a native option. So I finally get a chance to explore and experience what I could only watch before! In a few hours now, I am already thoroughly engrossed in the world that they created so long ago. I bought all 3 enhanced games actually, so there is a lot of fun ahead! For the combined $40 that I spent, I expect that I will get at least a couple hundred hours out of the games, and from what I have seen already, I will. Value in gaming has become rare nowadays.. and, to me, for what I will get out of it, this is a real value ;)'),
