	 ('16448969','76561198026805812','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'I would LOVE to love this game, but it''s kinda hard when there are so many bugs just killing it for me. This game has been out for a little longer than two years now, and there are still obvious bugs that need to be fixed. 

