	 ('6014289','76561198057246223','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'This game is so much fun. easy to pick up and play and featuring some of the most iconic charactesr from games and film. Voice acted with casual banter, off the cuff insults, and random humor aplenty, even the casual beginner poker player can enjoy this. Also, featuring additional bounty buy-ins like Sam''s Banjo or Ash''s Necronomicon, these items are not just cutsey achievement unlockers, but are also useful in-game items in other games such as Team Fortress 2, making all that much more fun to win a special buy in item.'),
