	 ('161511598','76561198095506754','3330','20251230',0,0,0,0,5,'Very fun, but it''s also too primitive for today''s standards when it comes to accessibility.

As someone with visual problems, the later levels are a true hell. The lines move very quickly and I keep having trouble differentiating between the balls'' colors, especially when there are one or two different balls in a long string of identical ones. A high contrast option would''ve been appreciated.

On top of that, the game resolution is locked at a 640x480, so either I play it in a tiny rectangle that only makes things more difficult or I put it in widescreen and then the image is stretched so badly it''s nauseating.

A great game, but very hard to enjoy properly in modern systems. Shouldn''t have been that hard to release a simple patch to fix some of these issues.'),
