	 ('9618095','76561197994224400','3330','20251230',48,1,0,0,9,'The SteamPlay icon says this game runs on Macs.  It lies.  Okay, technically it *does* run on old Macs; the system requirements list "OS:OS X version 10.5.8".  That doesn''t mean "or newer", that''s [i]just that release[/i]. So if you''re still rockin'' Leopard it''s a good game and probably one of the few that will run on a system of that vintage.  Or it''s great if you have a PC, which is where all my play has happened. Newer Macs, don''t waste your money.  Thumbs up for the game itself, thumbs down for the misleading labeling of supported systems.'),
