	 ('7803355','76561198018700790','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'This game is so rigged when I''m trying to get a prize for another game. You beat at least 3 of the opponents at the table, and for some reason at the last second you go all-in and you got like 3 Aces straight, the last opponent (Usaully Max), seems to get the last second advantage and all your hard earned pot was lost. This is just my luck, even though it happened to me 4-5 times, but you''ll probably be a more fortunate player. Yes, after what all happened to me, I do recommend this game.'),
