	 ('9370246','76561197998410113','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'All the fun of Poker Night 1 but even more to offer.  An all new cast of cult classic characters will have you laughing hard at their discussions and bickering.  The poker is just as good as ever and you can read more in my Poker Night 1 review to see what I mean and this time they even added an Omaha style just to mix it up a bit.  The addition of the odds screen is a fun little aspect and something I wished was in the first one.  Again their are lots of unlockables but with the bonus that if everything is deployed for a single character the entire Inventory changes and they get a new outfit.  Speaking of, more bounty unlockables for extra content in Team Fortress 2 , Borderlands 2, etc.  

The dialogue was one of the best and worst things about Poker Night 1 in that the first time you hear something funny about or from a character you especially like it''s hillarious.  At least until the 6th time you''ve heard it.  There are much much more conversations between characters so the repitition is way less but unavoidably there is some.  The only real problem is coincidently the infamous host of this game: GlaDos.  She was the big reason everyone was talking about this game but she''s actually the worst part of it because all of her dialogue is criticism of you.  You bet and she scolds you, you fold and she scolds you, you go all-in and she scolds you, you call a bet and she scolds you, you win the game and the scolds you (no, not joking).  And her lines are much fewer and are by far the most annoying and repetitive you will hear.  I''ve gotten a reflex when I see her come down from the cieling I mute my sound and when she leaves I unmute it and it''s way better.

Anyway, point is that I enjoy card games like Spades, Solitaire, and Hearts that come with computers and this is that times 100 with Moxxi''s cleavage on top of it.  I play it every week.'),
	 ('185158728','76561198089385440','3009850','20251230',5,0,0,0,7,'This game can be a RAIL pain in the ass when it likes to screw you over.

