	 ('174720758','76561198254067147','3009850','20251230',1,0,0,0,1,'This game is absolutely fantastic. I already have 14 hours into it and my goodness the stories I will list about it are as identical to the crazy stories I had in the original Hard Time. The police system is probably one of my new favorite features. And it feels like every new character you play as is going to have a different story that you will remember.

1st Playthrough "Gave a dude a rock bottom. He peed himself and I got wanted for assault and was sentenced to death.

2nd Playthrough. I find a water gun and think there''s no harm to it if I keep spraying a guard with it. He strangely dies from the water gun LOL. And then I die from a warden taking me down into dynamite and I''m blown up

3rd Playthrough. As a guard I end up arresting like 4 dudes for vandalism when clearly i put them through the objects. And then finally I GOT arrested for Vandalism! And got a taste of my own medicine and got locked up. Then i became a cool prisoner who lost their hand and fought until the end until they fell of a vending machine and died. 

Basically this game is always going to have a different result and story everytime you start a new character. If you want a game with endless unpredictable moments. And lots of action, comedy, and whackiness. This game is for you! 10/10'),
	 ('38713602','76561198025766671','500670','20251230',0,0,0,0,0,'+Very Fast-Paced Gameplay with lots of meaningful decisions every split-second 
