	 ('7851519','76561198047603209','234710','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'Okay, let''s get started.
Poker Night 2 combines all different characters from games in a match of hold em'' or ohama. That''s it, TellTale?
Well, here''s the point. This game dosen''t feel ''complete'' in an any way. If you''re blaming the now technological standards, go play Watch Dogs when it comes out. What I''m saying here is this game isn''t complete. If a game dosen''t feel complete to me, I wouldn''t like it that much. Away from the flaws, this game has good graphics and I like the way you win rewards for TF2 and BL2.
