	 ('62007417','76561198120023130','234710','20251230',3,1,0,0,10,'Fairly decent poker game.  Nothing fancy.  No online play.  But, it''s fun to play against the included characters as they''re all familiar to me.  It''s getting together with the most mixed bunch of poker buddies I can imagine short of inviting Steve from Minecraft and Hunter S. Thompson as added bonus.

