	 ('89238256','76561197970945013','1197770','20251230',24,1,0,0,10,'[h1] Overall: [/h1]
~I found this game mostly enjoyable.  There''s a bit of humor.  It doesn''t take itself too seriously.  And I found it arousing at several points.  If you''re looking for a game that will take about 5 hours to complete and seeing Lilly running around town naked while getting laid a couple dozen times, then this is a game for you.

[h1] Negatives:  [/h1]
-The game isn''t polished.  You will clip through walls, rocks, trees, etc. on a regular basis.
-Camera is constantly moving through buildings and causing strange loading effects on characters and the landscape.
-The textures and structures aren''t uniform, some objects will seem somewhat well textured, then right next to it is a flat muddy object that looks like it came out of a Sega Saturn era game.
-The models used for NPCs in the game are very ugly and contrast poorly against Lilly and even the monsters you fight.
-The battles are bland and overly simple.  Attack and hope your random dice roll lets you hit.  After the fight, stand on some white flowers for a few seconds to fully heal.  Once you get the distraction ability you''ll be able to land a hit every single time (no critical though).  You''ll probably never use a health potion after that point.  You''ll likely finish the game with 60+ health potions.
-Armor and weapons seem to do nothing. 

[h1] Positives: [/h1]
+This is actually a game more than most adult content on Steam.  It took me 7 hours to complete and I collected and fought everything possible (which was very easy).
+Lilly is attractive and the voice actress does a good job of aiding the arousal and humor of the game.
+The Goddess is also an appealing character to listen to.
+The sex scenes were good.  That''s an important one for adult content.  Though you can only control speed and camera position during them.
 
[h1] Critics for improvement or a possible sequel: [/h1]
=More interactivity with the characters in town.  Allow us to bang anyone?  Perhaps a small quest for each person to achieve this.  Like the dildo fetch quest.
=Bang the monsters/enemies as an alternative to fighting.  Different ending for being prude or slutty?
=A sexual frustration/arousal meter that needs to be built up over time through sexual activity with multiple characters or quests to unleash a powerful ability. 
=Character customization!  I think Lilly is attractive, but she may not appeal to everyone.  The ability to create your own character or at least have a few presets to choose from would be a big improvement.
=I would have liked to have seen the Goddesses voice actress portrayed as a MILF character to bang.
'),
