	 ('106916761','76561198304974200','584640','20251230',3,0,0,0,7,'[h1]スーパーチキンジャンパーかわいい [eng and pt-br review][/h1]
This game has everything a good game needs: simple gameplay that never gets repetitive as it evolves through the game, waifu pixel art decent and done right, awesome music, exciting story, fun, bad ass motherchicker protagonist and more important: uncle jokes that make you laugh out of pity.
All this in a game that is small in price but big in replay.
Only downside is that in the end it depends more on luck than skill.
[b]Note: don''t see the video of the game in the store, it''s full of spoilers, if you want this game just get it now[/b]
[hr][/hr]
