	 ('7889779','76561198040421105','234710','20251230',1,0,0,0,9,'A game of poker with quips from the likes of Brock Samson from the Venture Brothers, Ash from Evildead, Claptrap from Borderlands, along with the Freelance Police Sam and Max. Oh, and you, the silent player. Play hands of Texas Hold ''Em or Omaha with the host GLaDOS from Portal. Go down as one of the greater poker players at the green table, or be a tremendous failure after busting and losing $20,000 (You''ll most likely be busted by Ash, he''s an ass like that). A good, casual game to pass the time if you have a few minutes. Sadly, there''s no multiplayer and no other characters besides the ones listed above. Buy this during a sale for less than 5 dollars if you have some money to burn and want a casual game to play once in a while. Get it if you really like poker, otherwise you might want to throw your money somewhere else. 

A bonus to this game would be the multiple TF2 items you get from collecting "special items" from each of the characters, such as a Spike TV 2012 VGA award from Claptrap. To get them, you have to do a series of simple bounties during one tournament, and beat the next tournament to win the item. The TF2 items are quite nice, but the weapons have no value or different stats except for being achievement items.'),
