	 ('17857550','76561198084468692','375460','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'Too full of bugs to really be worth it, at least in its current state. Save files don''t work, often causing hours of lost progress. Achievements don''t get unlocked when they should be. Were it not for those things, this game would probably be an okay trading game, very simple to play but frustrating to accomplish anything in because of high travel costs. Unless you get phenomenally lucky with some good buy-low-sell-high cities, playing this game involves hours of repetitive gameplay with little to keep a player entertained beyond, "Maybe this time I can turn a slight profit and not have it be stolen by bandits."

