	 ('195262974','76561198145884626','2427430','20251230',13,2,0,0,9,'I don''t understand how GSC wanted to surprise with the release of these editions. This should have been done at least before the release of STALKER 2, so that people could somehow brighten up the wait. What do we actually have?

The first thing I encountered was the inability to save the game; the settings do not apply after restarting the game. The main and obvious bugs have also not been fixed, plus new ones have appeared (for example, you cannot discharge weapons in the inventory and walk at the same time, the main character simply stops). 

And now about what I came across during the passage:
1) The dialog numbers have been removed, now you can not answer by pressing the numbers;
2) They removed most of the buttons in PDA for interacting with the map. Map is always trying to center on the player, why?;
3) When searching the UAV, two memory modules are taken, only one can be unlocked, the second one will remain in the backpack until the end of the game;
4) The scale of properties of body armor and weapons has visually deteriorated;
5) Professor Ozersky''s scanner can be picked up several times;
6) Herman says that there are artifacts in the anomalous zones. When you hover over the map, it says that there are no;
7) Stalkers still don''t kill mutants near bases and can just walk around with them in their arms;
8) Stalkers periodically run across the entire map during tasks (I had this with the Spartacus squad);
9) It is impossible to switch to another application while playing the game (or rather, it very often does not work);
10) The Zulu still sometimes does not move from school to the laundry.
11) The controller in the X-8 appears behind an iron door. If you don''t have a Gauss cannon with you, then I can wish you good luck;
12) For some reason, the "Center the map on the task" function was added for tasks that simply do not have labels on the map;
13) Lieutenant Sokolov patrolled dormitory near the laundry room (before the evacuation), and after the cutscene (with Strelok) he moved back to the laundry room, this was not even in the original;
14) The main character occasionally takes damage, although I can stand near the merchants at this moment;
15) Why change the achievement icons in the PDA?

Many people call this edition a remaster, but in fact it''s just a port from the console. The game has degraded in many aspects. As for me, all the games had to be brought to the same denominator - to make them on the Call of Pripyat engine.

And yes, since when did the russian language begin to belong to the Russia? Well, you took away their opportunity to buy games, but why ruin one of the main components of the atmosphere? The characters speak different languages (tthe plot characters speak english, the rest in russian (yes, it was not completely removed) and ukrainian, that is, in three languages!!!) with the same language setting, it''s unbearable to listen to. There is no single voice acting even for ukrainian.'),
