	 ('175492247','76561197990739641','3009850','20251230',1,0,0,0,1,'This one needs a bit more time in the oven before I can recommend it. I''ve really liked some of this guy''s other games, but this one needs slightly more structure, more to do, and get rid of a ton of quirks that make this just not fun to play. I can work past a lot of the problems, but I can''t have fun when I''m failing every mission because people won''t stop talking to me about where I can find a table and who has a crush on me.
