	 ('142108020','76561199380504686','840930','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'[h1] Slow down or speed up? [/h1]
The games made by this manufacturer are generally simple, this one is slightly more difficult, the main gameplay is to avoid collisions by clicking the mouse to slow down the movement of the ball.
However, keeping pressing the mouse and releasing it to accelerate the ball when you need to do some evasions maybe the batter way to play.
PS: After the score is high, it is best not to take the buff by shifting deliberately, especially the time pause. When the time pause ends, you''ll be lucky enough to hit it directly :)

[h1] 减速或加速？ [/h1]
这家厂商的游戏普遍比较简单，这个有一点点难，主要玩法是通过点击鼠标来减慢小球移动来规避碰撞，然而一直按住鼠标在需要规避的时候松开它加速，反而会是一个更好的方法让你去玩到后面。
玩到分越来越高的时候，最好不要刻意减速去拿buff，尤其是时停，幸运的话有可能在结束的时候直接撞上（笑'),
