	 ('1492570','76561197993757686','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'pros: two gameplay modes (Texas Hold''em and Omaha), several unlockable themes (for chips, cards, table), great soundtrack, funny cast of characters, addition of challenges that allows you to unlock items for Borderlands 2 and TF2 (instead of restarting a match until someone puts an item on the table like on the first game)

