	 ('51672408','76561198121805690','375460','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'I hardly ever traded any goods on this game. Only when I knew for sure they would make a profit, but even if they did, it was not much. Then quests only give enough money for travel, not really enough to make money. The only way to make fast progression, and constant progression is to constantly save, reloading when something goes bad. Then pretty much double your money in the mines eventually sitting there and hiring 3500 workers, mining, and then firing all the workers. Takes a long time since you can only hire 5 at a time, and just have to spam 2 buttons over and over again. Then there is also some real time involved. Best to move around until finding an active mine, mine it, then wait until the next day, real life day, to mine again. So this game is old enough where the player has to quit the game, wait 24 hours, and get back on the next day.
EDIT: This game at its core is trash. Took me a couple days to realize this. This is marketed as a trading/caravan style game, yet it does not have those essential features. It has real life days factored into it as if the writer was just learning about MMO games.'),
