	 ('10700546','76561197979417023','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'You get to play cards with some of the best, iconic characters in video games, comics, television, and movies... and also you get to play with Claptrap.

In all seriousness though, this is a great game for people who felt Poker Night 1 was too easy.  Your opponents are more aggressive and smarter, and are more likely to recognize when they have a good hand, or when they know you can''t afford to call their bluff.  The game may seem like it cheats, but in all honesty, that''s how odds work in poker.  There are times I shouldn''t have won but did.  The game requires brains AND guts, and if you have only one or the other, you may find yourself furstrated.  But don''t let that discourage you - it''s a great way to get your brain working and to build up your guts a bit, so I whole-heartedly recommend this game.'),
