[*]+ Lots of swearing (Don''t like it? Fuck off!)
[*]+ Funny replicas of the demon, after the death of the character.
[*]+ Fast gameplay
[*]+ Simple controls
[*]+ Achievements
[*]+ Trading cards for sale (does not pay off the game)
