	 ('76741077','76561199061145078','3330','20251230',5,0,0,0,10,'This may be a blast from the past, but it is fun nonetheless. It''s a "marble-match" type game, in which you point and shoot a ball at other balls of matching color. The goal is to clear the board before the balls get swallowed by whatever creature resides in the drain. The music is initially fun, but quickly becomes annoying. (Luckily, you can adjust the volume of the music.) The sound of the balls clanking together is very satisfying. Imagine the sound of balls clanking together on a pool table. If you like casual games that *don''t* demand constant buy-ups or spamming your friends to proceed through the game, try Zuma.'),
