Don''t worry The computer in question only guides you through areas of complication If you don''t have any savvey/savey (Both spellings are right) Of what your actually doing , although by now you should have been given enough input by Your computer guide.
SO OFF On your journey....    The detail to graphics in some areas  are better than others or i should say Are Better Than Most designs from (Laurence llewlyn-Bowen)  ... Ok.... Bit Harsh...  maybe i Just don''t like his Style    & Thats More than i can say for the Game...  As it flows Forward to different areas You can only But  investigate every nook & cranny Because you WANT more from this pursue of interest.
