	 ('4944620','76561198043609914','234710','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'Poker night 2 is a much better sequel to an already awesome game. Poker night 2 has the most random charecters that dont mix at all Claptrap from Borderlands 2, Brock from Venture bros, Ash from Evil dead, Sam from sam and max and Galados from Portal as your dealer. Youre there because you want to play some poker. Now going in its way harder than the first game. Ai will know when youre bluffing or when you get them drunk they will use bad cards in your favour. The gameplay stays the same from the first one. Also the jokes are funny as hell but they do repeat themselfs.  Also they added a new mode which is omaha which is a nice edition but now about the loot. Not only do you get in game loot which looks amazing such as Poker felts, cards and chips but also you get Borderlands 2 skins and also Team fortress 2 items.Overall you have an awesome game which is fun as hell and worth it so go ahead and check it and if youre tight on buget pick this one instead of the first but if you have enought money for both thats awesome so go ahead and check it out i give it a 8.5/10'),
