	 ('20513866','76561198049315903','386990','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'On first glance, you get a vaugely lesbian cutesy visual novel with a few gameplay choices sprinkled here and there. The main thing that stands out is the art, which is A+ pretty.

The REAL kicker for me was how this relates to historical figures; namely the Lake Poets (Southey, Coleridge, and Wordsworth). You also get an additional Byron and Shelley- but wait, there''s more! They''re cute high school girls. Yes, they behave like their real-life couterparts; and if you have a thing for the Romantics or have a little Gothic sensiblilty, you''ll dig this gem just like I do. 
