	 ('7876828','76561198020934704','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Buy it when it goes on sale and have a few laughs.  The characters, setting, and banter are great.  Just don''t expect the actual poker part to be fun.  This game cheats and it cheats HARD.  In real life, your odds of getting heads in a coinflip is 1:2.  In this game, it''s more like 1:6.

