	 ('26401253','76561198245710364','513320','20251230',5,0,0,0,10,'I only have 2 hours in the game so far but it is amazing so far! The graphics were rough at first (1080) because of the issues they were having but promptly fixed it and it looks amazing now. I have in-game set to 220 scaling with graphic settings maxed out and it runs great. I like the puzzles mixed in and like that they aren''t too hard to where you get frustrated. The gameplay is slow but I like that for an exploration game like this. I like starting out in a desert with similar feeling to The Solus Project and then making your way into the city. The sound is great. I only have 1 small complaint so far and it''s really small but I had a hard time turning around the dune buggy in tight areas. Everyone begs for a story-driven game for the Vive and the devs delivered. I definitely recommend this game! Good job guys.'),
