	 ('122732750','76561199050686855','3330','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'Zuma Deluxe it''s not a bad game. It''s a good casual game well made, but to be honest, I didn''t enjoyed it. I DON''T MEAN IT''S BAD, simply, I got bored of it.

