	 ('95716137','76561198152895445','500670','20251230',1,0,0,0,1,'This game is psychological torture. 
The rules are simple: You shoot something, it dies. You get shot, you die. Even bosses get killed in one hit.
The point is, that''s all this game offers: An arena full of demons that shoot you from offscreen, some upgrades for your gun if you can pull off some trickshots.
With a few upgrades you can almost feel like a god, able to wipe out waves of demons with just a few shots, just to see all of your progress taken away from you in a split second, when a fucking basic demon of the same color of the blood-covered ground decides to walk up to your ass and murder you, as you were just trying to keep an eye on the 1000 bullets on screen that you have to dodge.

Achievements are impossible.

The best part is by far the music tho, makes DOOM''s soundtrack feel like a lullaby.

I got this game on a summer sale while it was -90% and i am still confident it was the best euro i ever wasted.

TL,DR;
This game is like putting your balls in a blender. 
Should you buy it? I dont fucking know you do you.'),
