	 ('54257374','76561198006758487','386990','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Wow, Samantha is a wreck.

This is a very sentimental VN. At times exccessively so, all with the self-pity of our main heroine.
The other cast, consisting of her best friend and love interest, being increasingly irritated and unable to deal with the MC, the story captures the turning point of whether bonds can be repaired or shatter forever. What the latter means for an extremely fickle and depressive character, should not be hard to guess.

Me being myself, I had a great time empathizing with any and each of the characters. I loved the art and the writing, though I am not at all familar with english poets or poets in general it''s been nice touching on the matter.
On the improvable side I think DeQuincey deserved a little more screen time and the unsufferable Georgia could have stood a little more opposition. 

Nevertheless: Please make more of this!'),
