	 ('132599461','76561198125215874','1302780','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Eh, this one, it was a-okay, it''s A "Switch your platform around to clear a zone kind of td game"
So you basically always start slow, unless you use extra energy, you need some planning on what (units-aka towers) to place, and which (Floor - aka path) to defense against

Pros:
1) It had a medal upgrade system, mix 3 of the same level= 1 level above the current, so, as you can guessed, you need some grinding
2) You also had another currency, your coins, so it will take you some time to get the upgrades for gadgets, and powerups, and medal fusing
3) A number of units to choose from
4) Different types of enemy
5) Different types of gadgets
6) Different obstacles (mechanics) to go against
7) A skill tree? basically a tree of passive upgrades
8) In game achivements that rewards you upon completion
9) Good amount of achievements

Cons:
1) Too grindy...
2) Felt like a chore to play
3) The upgrades are not even fun
4) Grinding for achievements is crazy

I got it on a sale, if you don''t mind yet another zombie td game for another 90+ achievements...grab it then

'),
