	 ('47421795','76561197971007531','513320','20251230',4,0,0,0,9,'I liked the idea of this game - exploration is what VR was made for but I played for an hour and got sick and bored. Firstly I have an Oculus and Teleportation DOES NOT work. The website claims it does, there''s even a button for it but it does nothing. Continuous motion moving around is a recipe for motion sickness - that''s why every other game uses (or at least offers) teleport. 
