	 ('153338322','76561198055708379','584640','20251230',2,1,0,0,2,'While I understand the overwhelmingly positive reviews, I''ll give it a NO, but...

This game suffers something that, unfortunately, plagues most of brazilian games: the gameplay is simply terrible.
As a brazilian it saddens me to see so many games with nice artwork, nice ideas, nice story, nice humor (when applied) ruined  by bad gameplay.

In this game I can understand and tolerate its randomness and high difficult spikes. It''s clearly a "Meat Boy''esque" game and it''s supposed to be tough. But I can''t stand those completely weird (to say the least) hitboxes.
Sometimes you hit, sometimes you miss. Sometimes you can hit something safely, sometimes you''re too close and die.

The UI isn''t great as well, but you can deal with it.

For such a cheap game, frantic and easy gameplay, it''s easy to understand its success.

But even so, it could have a bit more polish.
