	 ('195362050','76561198267394697','2427430','20251230',7,0,0,0,9,'If all you want is to play the series with better textures, bug fixes and a higher framerate cap right out of the box, then this will do

For everyone else, just get get the original series in GOG or with a key and install a mod pack
