Now to get to my last point I noticed how you guys are blaming negative reviews * on angry russian trolls * that is incorrect the majority of us are not russian and censoring art ( which the original stalker games were) is a violation of freedom of expression in which is protected in the united states Constitution under the first amendment. This shows the world that Ukraine is taking freedom away from the original creators, artist, voice actors that were all ukrainian and who brought this game to the world stage. I donated personally to ukraine in the past when the war broke out but now I will no longer will. the original version is superior and so are the mods I suggest anyone new to stalker don''t play the enhanced edition  it is not right what they are doing.'),
