	 ('192479698','76561198003718858','3009850','20251230',5,0,0,0,10,'Hard Time III is straight-up chaos in prison form—and that’s kind of the charm. You’re thrown into a wild jail where you can fight, make friends (or enemies), craft stuff, and basically just try to survive the madness. There’s a ton going on, and half the time you’re either starting a fight or accidentally getting into one.

The graphics are a bit better than the old games, and there’s more stuff to do, like deeper convos and crafting. The camera can be a bit janky, and things get hectic fast, but if you’re into weird, unpredictable sandbox games, this one’s a blast.  The ability to become a civie or an Officer is also a great addition!

Rating: 10/10 – Dumb fun in the best way possible'),
