	 ('200006188','76561198019147469','2427430','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'Played this right after Shadow of Chernobyl, skipped Clear Sky. This is definitely better than SoC. Story is a bit more interesting but the biggest improvement is the overall gameplay. Still a bit buggy and janky but I guess it''s to be expected from this series (even the enhanced editions, I guess). If you enjoyed the previous Stalker games, then you''ll most likely enjoy this one as well.'),
