	 ('37430529','76561197994870015','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'Why there is no Poker Night 3 boggles the mind. Actually, it''s kind of surprising that there''s not a new Poker Night every year. Or at least DLC with new characters and um...ya know...multiplayer?

I say this because Poker Night 2 is one of the best poker games availible on PC. It has enough personality to be interesting to people who have little or no outside interest in Poker while still being one of the more polished efforts in the genre. 

Even entering into the year 2018, a lot of Poker/Card/Gambling games STILL look and play like absolute trashware from AOLGames circa 1998. 

Poker Night 2 captures the tension, the excitement, the boredom, the burnout, and most importantly the trash and small talking that takes place inbetween while playing high stakes poker with other offbeat degenerates. Some of the dialogue is really funny. But it just doesn''t go far enough.

More dialouge, more characters, more situational based interactions and (especially) more statistics would make this game exponentially better.

Yes, it''s still perhaps the best Poker game availible, but you still can''t help but wish they''d gone even further.

P.S. The idea that they bothered to get the rights to Ash as a character but didn''t actually have Bruce do the voice is pretty insulting. And lame. But it fits the generally frustrating tone of the game: this is great, but it''s not as good as it could be.'),
	 ('37895612','76561198023894564','234710','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'A fun little single player poker game.  The game creates a fun atmosphere with interesting characters from some of my favorite games and shows.  The conversations are fun at first, but will drain on you after some time.  The game plays a little too slow, but still bearable for the most part.  If you are looking for an interesting poker game to play, I would recommend this game.  If you want a more serious poker game, or multiplayer, then this is not the game you want.  I bought it on sale, would do again, would not buy at full price.'),
	 ('16650144','76561197976516187','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'the game is rigged, just happen to be playing, and start winning with pair of kings and queens, AI just magically pulls out three of a kind, or a straight, or a flush, absolutely rigged rubbish, dont bother buying it.

You can go ahead and try and win with good combinations, but unless you are getting the best cards, you are not going to win at all, played the game, had a great set on a straight, AI magically pulls a flush out of their ass, totally rigged.'),
