	 ('62207234','76561198237407288','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Fun to play, good content and enjoy the free stuff for tf2'),
	 ('9727774','76561198125098050','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'I was hesistant to pick up this game knowing I dont know how to play poker but after 2 hours with the game I have had so much fun despite me still not knowing how to play. When you start the game they give you information on how to play poker but it would''ve been better for a tutorial that tells you what to do in the game. The dialogue of the characters is amazing with a bit of repeating but I still thought it was great. The reactions are also great to see which is what you dont see in a normal poker game. Dont hesistate its only $5 which is way to low for what the game is worth. If you know poker 9.5/10. If you dont 8/10.'),
	 ('195094323','76561198018194892','3009850','20251230',3,0,0,0,2,'Judge deemed a good punishment cutting my arm off  (yes, and you even have a black screen cutscene where you hear a saw and a scream, no anesthetics apparently) and chaining me to a bald man for a month so we have to walk toghether everywhere.
What did I do to deserve such punishment?

"Pronuncing silent P''s"

Deserved I guess

That said, I was a superfan of the mobile version along with supercity, and what it brings me a lot of joy about this one is not that MDickie did  a 3d version. It''s horrible. Controlling with a keyboard is like dragging ur crotch through a mile of broken glass. But Hard time was super fun and now he''s adding a ton of stupid and funny stuff and he''s actually listening to  people advices and lot of the "easy way outs" that before worked and allowed you to massacre an entire prison with a bottle and get out unscathed are now no more, the game has that difficulty that keeps you there but you don''t get bored because of the massive stupid stuff and havoc that happens at any moment.

Good work MDickie, and please keep listening to people suggestions.'),
	 ('67450338','76561198161801363','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'Great game there was more content in the first but still a very good poker game sad you cant buy any more would have liked to get this for my parents'),
	 ('66010665','76561198812785334','3330','20251230',0,0,0,0,0,'There is no way the colors you are given are chosen by random chance.  This game must have been designed to piss people off into putting more quarters into the machine.

Edit: I wrote the above after rage quitting several times.  I''ll leave it up as evidence despite it making me look like an idiot.  After learning more about how the game works I don''t hate it so much.  You really have to pay attention to the hints on the loading screen.  They tell you the rules that keep you from needing to rage quit (as often).  The game mechanics are not so obvious that just looking at it tells you how it works.

Fun game for mindless time wasting when you need it.'),
	 ('37916554','76561198007821061','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'I paid 99 cents for this game, so for that price it was worth it.  Claptrap thinks he''s hilarious when he''s about as funny as a heart attack.  GLADoS makes irritating comments at every other action I take.  Sam and Ash are alright.  Brock saves this game and makes it worth playing, because his voice actor is always awesome.'),
