	 ('28846650','76561198059670127','513320','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'I would say only buy this game if you are running out of VR content, as there are far better games out there. The atmosphere was really great and I like the tie in with Alice in Wonderland storyline. It only took a little over 4 hours to complete, so the game is definetely short, but it looks like there are additional achievements I can go back for with an additional run. The gravity paths do not work well with VR and can cause motion sickness. Driving the buggy was cool, but again, It could cause motion sickness for some. A few bugs here and there, but overall an ok experience.'),
