	 ('35764772','76561198055498625','386990','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'A wonderful medium length, non-kinetic visual novel about a young woman dealing with depression and unrequieted love. It tells the story of a class trip to the countryside and the interactions of said young lady with her peers along a number of different story arcs. It''s beautifully written and illustrated (both characters and backgrounds). The music was also great and flowed nicely with the story. Unfortunately, there is no voice acting. For those interested in achievement gathering, there is a skip option, as well as guides that walk you through the game pretty quickly. It really is worth the time to read all the branches though, as the writing is superb. It also has both achievements and trading cards. I''ve enjoyed all the ebi-hime visual novels I''ve read on Steam and am looking forward to the ones I haven''t yet gotten to.'),
