	 ('13050228','76561198089642244','234710','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'Whether or not I reccomend this game was kind of a toss up at first, because I love playing poker games and this one is pretty funny. 

 Unfortunately there are is a major issue for me. No matter how many times I re-install this game it just won''t work at all for me. I''ve tried installing it on four different computers (multiple times) and each time it crashes before it even gets to the title screen. That''s a huge issue, and a lot of other people I''ve talked to have had the same one.

I''ve played on a friend''s account where it worked half the time, and it was a pretty nice game. It had humourous dialouge and made me feel like I was good at poker. It had a lot of downsides though. The jokes became pretty monotinous after a few hands, often cycling through ones that were said just moments before and after a while you had heard every one. There are non-skipable scenes in this as well, which makes farming for the items that you can get a bit frustrating. It often ignores your hands as well in the game, allowing for an NPC to win when you clearly would.

The negative aspects outweigh the positive, but since I personally like playing poker games I purchased it I was hoping to play it when I wanted to killl some time (the items being a nice bonus too). Since it doesn''t work for me and I ended up wasting my money and my time by installing it over and over, I''m giving it a negitive review. 

But if you want you can take a chance, because it may work for you. Good luck. :3'),
	 ('195406225','76561197970660942','2427430','20251230',20,4,0,0,5,'I didn''t believe the negative reviews but I checked myself and it''s true: The creators of this game want to erase Soviet history and legacy from their games. I wonder who would want to erase the history of the greatest heroes the world has ever seen - the heroic soldiers who gave their lives to defeat the Naz*s?

Hmmm... probably people who support Naz*s. 

I thought this would be fake news and some attempt by Russia to troll and paint Ukrainians as Naz*s, but no. It''s real. They edited their game to remove Soviet legacy. This is not only an insult to the brave Ukrainian soldiers who fought against the evil of capitalist imperialism and for a socialist future, it reflects badly on Ukraine and gives credibility to Russian accusations of Ukrainians being Naz*s. 

Shameful, to be honest. Really, REALLY shameful behaviour by the developers.'),
