	 ('174131379','76561199010429459','3330','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'Zuma Deluxe is an incredibly engaging and addictive puzzle game that has stood the test of time. Developed by PopCap Games, it combines simple yet challenging gameplay with vibrant graphics and captivating sound effects.
One of the standout features of Zuma Deluxe is its easy-to-learn mechanics. Players control a stone frog idol that shoots colored balls to match three or more of the same color, clearing them from the screen. This straightforward concept quickly becomes addictive as the levels progress and the difficulty increases.

The game offers a variety of modes, including Adventure and Gauntlet, which provide different challenges and keep the gameplay fresh and exciting. The bright colors and enchanting music add to the overall experience, making it enjoyable for players of all ages
Zuma Deluxe is perfect for anyone looking for a fun and relaxing way to pass the time. Its addictive nature ensures that you’ll keep coming back for more, aiming to beat your high scores and complete all the levels Whether you’re a casual gamer or a puzzle enthusiast, Zuma Deluxe is a must play'),
