	 ('28552593','76561197970674137','234710','20251230',5,1,0,0,10,'On sale for less than $2, this game could be dog shit in a bag and it might still get a positive recommendation... 

As it turns out, this is actually a brilliant way to spice up a game of virtual Poker.  Great characters, plenty of well done voice acting, interesting unlockables, and good atmosphere (revealing that last card can be very suitably tense).

Some of the jokes get old after you hear them over and over, especially the long ones though.

Shame it never got DLC to expand the cast of AI players, I wouldn''t mind rotating players in and out every now and then.'),
