	 ('199423802','76561197995594502','840930','20251230',0,1,0,0,2,'[b]May I dare say that this game is a depiction of how to navigate life in capitalism.[/b]

You''re a circle, doing circle things (working), being efficient by doing your repetitive duties. As you try to consistently do your best in life, people with prejudice against your shape try to attack and destroy you, but you [i]slow down[/i], persevere and grow your bank account (points). The bigger your bank account, the more capitalistic things you can buy (skins). 

While working, you may be lucky and get a good project (+2 points), work overtime (reduce pressure from peers), or almost get fired in a mass layoff (nuke again). Other times you may watch close colleagues get fired (near-miss).

There''s no winning in capitalism, there''s only grind. That''s what this game is, a grind for infinite money, showing how you should achieve(ment) at least a basic 80k bank account through meritocracry.

[b]Score: 5/10[/b] - [i]Average[/i]'),
