	 ('166302253','76561198802396641','3330','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'This is one of the most incredible games you will ever lay eyes upon. It balances challenge and entertainment exactly perfect. The sound of the balls clacking together is 100% real balls. The colors and brightness of the balls compliment each other excellent. The background music has been created with the happy tears of mozart himself. You break tf down to the beat every time. The controls.. imagine you are a rusty screw on a dry day and you get hit with a fresh spritz of wd-40. Thats all I have to say about that. All of the power ups are helpful and lend a saving hand just when you think that youre on the brink of death, heart racing, gut sinking.. boom. reverse ball. The mighty Zuma lives up to his name.'),
