	 ('201887134','76561198103339127','2427430','20251230',2,1,0,0,9,'[h1]Almost Perfect Remaster actually....[/h1]
Despite all my hate to CoP back in the day
Despite the fact that CoP spawned ANOMALY and GAMMA
Despite all the cut content (USSR and Everything Russian - although you can mod back everything, literally)
I just cant hate this

Visuals got a LOT better. They fixed the blur, no more fog in the distance, no stutters. Runs super smooth and no stuters, simply amazing. Also shadows, no more glitching helicopter shadows.

Nothing is changed in the plot, characters, music or levels, aside from small cuts  here and there

The gameplay became somewhat easier. You dont get stuck in geometry no more, you run FAST, like REAL FAST and some quests got tweaked so you can be done with them faster and move on.

Finally, there''s a replay value and if you''re new - you''ll probably love it
For veterans - there''s now Steam Achievements and boy oh boy - those were bad to do.
There''s too much ENTIRE Quest Lines to do, then reload and do THE SAME AGAIN but for other side
There''s also stashes and artifact hunting but at least its not as bad as in previous entries.

[h1]Final Score - 9/10[/h1]
If not for the censorship - I''d close my eyes on small bugs and cheevos and say - This Is A Perfect Remaster'),
