	 ('42090835','76561198106443307','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,8,'I was in a poker class at school and even though it was just for fun and we weren''t getting graded, I still wanted some practice so I would actually have a chance against the rest of the class. I got both this game and the original Poker Night, and I really enjoy both! I think I enjoy Poker Night 2 more since Venture Bros and Portal 2 are some of my favorite things. Although I will say I go back to the original for the Heavy and how much I want to strangle Tycho (I''m not sure why I hate him so much, sometimes he''s likeable but other times I want him to get run over but a fuckin bus) . I''m not super good at poker, I get pulled into really stupid bluffs (god damnit Ash....It''s always Ash or Claptrap...) and even though I know basic poker stratagey I very rarely apply it. I play for fun, and fun I do have. If you like the idea of poker and don''t mind listening to Claptrap, I really reccomend this. If you''re a really serious poker player or someone who''s just buying it for the characters, don''t, it''s not for you. Or maybe it is, I''m not your mom'),
