	 ('32207958','76561198071101784','500670','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'This game is amazing! There is a surprising amount of depth packed into this game. I''ve sunk 20 hours in and still learning more strategies and techniques to get further up the leader board. The aesthetic of the game is awesome! It''s very comic book inspired with text popping up and over the top bloody explosions. The sound makes everything heavy and feel impactful and intense! The music is very fitting with a grungy, gritty, industrial electro-metal hybrid with unique tracks for bosses and various situations.

If you enjoy twinstick shooters and a challenge, you will love this game! 10/10 :D'),
