	 ('197975769','76561198071861331','500670','20251230',0,0,0,0,5,'This game can be your Tormentor, your X, and your Punisher. A brutally fast paced and difficult arena shooter that will kick your ass and challenge you to get up and keep fighting, over and over and over, until you''re worth a damn. Dusting off and going again has never been smoother or easier, as when you inevitably eat s**t all it takes is a single click to immediately dive in to another round without skipping a beat.

Everything about this beautifully simple experience not only goads you into facing its gauntlet as many times as you can stand it, but makes you excited to. Infectiously aggressive energy pouring from the voice of the protagonist, the music, your gun, your bullets, the little angel who comes to encourage you after every failure, you''ll be overflowing with pure uncut "F**K YOU FIGHT ME" fire if you only let this game burn you.

Quick to pick up, quick to play, but I''ll be trying to master it for god only knows how long. But more than worth picking up, especially if you catch it on a good sale. Go get em.'),
