	 ('39216792','76561198094554778','234710','20251230',14,46,0,0,0,'You''ve most probably bought this game to get those in-game tf2 items.

You then slowly learn the jist of how the bots react in the game and you bluff your way to the texas holdem tournament.

At long last, that in-game item you wanted for so long is on the table, and you say to yourself "I can do this".

One-by-one, you take out your opponents by using your now adquired strategies.

Finally, its a one on one against Ash Williams, you fold a few times because you dont get the right hands, when suddenly [b]HOLY CRAP 4 ACES AND A KING![/b], you cannot believe your luck! Its finally happening, at long last, you will get your hands on those sweet long fall loafers! As if a call from god himself, Ash Williams goes all in! Now, even though your chips are are worth 4 times as much as Ash''s, you go all in, to show that stupid AI how confident you are of destroying him.

You sit back and close your eyes waiting to hear Glados exclaim how your hand is a gift from the gods, and meanwhile you think of the different set ideas you have for your scout. However, your thoughts are interrupted by "The player has four of a kind, Ash has a straight flush. Ash wins the pot".

Suddenly, you find yourself in a state of paralysis, you desperately try to move your mouth to shout at the top of your lungs every swear word you know in existance, but you simply can''t, your in a deep state of anger and shock, you have been permanently damaged, and no one can ever repair you.

You now find yourself in a white facility, doctors in lab coats constantly try to make you recover from your state of trauma, but they can''t. Your family has stopped visiting you as your murderous face-expression terrifies them. You now just sit in a wheelchair all day, all night, every millisecond of your remaining life, wishing the most unimaginable things inflinged on Ash Williams'),
