	 ('87854024','76561198030311754','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'⭐ 10/10 – A Must-Play for Poker & Pop Culture Fans! ⭐

Telltale Games really delivered with Poker Night 2! This game isn’t just about poker—it’s about the fun, witty banter between some of the most iconic characters from gaming and pop culture. Playing against Brock Samson (The Venture Bros.), Claptrap (Borderlands), Ash Williams (Army of Darkness), and Sam (Sam & Max) is an absolute blast, and the Dealer, GLaDOS (Portal), steals the show with her sarcastic humor.

The dialogue is top-tier, making every match feel fresh and entertaining. On top of that, you can unlock cool in-game items for Borderlands 2, Team Fortress 2, and more. The poker itself is solid, with both Texas Hold’em and Omaha available, making it fun whether you''re a casual player or a seasoned pro.

If you’re a fan of poker, great writing, and hilarious interactions, Poker Night 2 is a must-have! It’s a shame it’s no longer available for purchase, but if you can find a way to play it, it’s absolutely worth it.

🎥 Check out some gameplay here: https://youtu.be/M1BidyiuSO0

💬 Final Verdict: If you love poker and comedy, you’ll love this! 🃏😂'),
