	 ('69819204','76561198120511464','1197770','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'The Good parts for Me are;  The game has a very nice look to it, kind of simple texture but great luminosity to it.  The protagonist has great smooth skin and the model is very well done.  The voice acting is very good and i was surprise that it actually felt ''real'' sometimes...matching the situation on screen making the scene way more exciting than the visual suggest.

The meh... parts for me are...; The story remind me of those soft porn movie of the 80''s where a protagonist has to go through sexual chalenge to reach and save the day, so it is very linear story.  This could have been better with multi path choices for enhance replayability, but it is still fun...   


The Bad parts for Me are; Although my machine as 3.5 Ghz 12 cores and 8 gig of ram, my 2gb ddr5 graphic card CAN''T crunch it.  The game to be playable have to be put on LOW setting.  I don''t know what this engine is, but it is not optimize for sure because any game i play normally run smoothly on ultra or very high setting.  Sad.  The fighting system is turn base but frustrating as you have to wait while the ennemi hit you and you can''t block or retreat.  Often you find yourself trying to hit when it is not yet your turn and watch the ennemi kill you.  Not fun. 

All in all i still believe the game as potential, but need some work yet to be really enjoyable.  if you have a really good machine, and 20$ to part with, this is not a bad game!  Just don''t expect a 3A game.
'),
