	 ('9105575','76561198110775318','234710','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'Bought this on a lark (and on sale), but it was way more fun than I expected, especially since I came in unfamiliar with all the games it refers to and includes characters from.  Has since made going through Portal and playing some Borderlands 2 on its free weekend that much more interesting.  Dialogue is pretty funny.  It''s not serious card-playing but it''s fun, and counter to what some claim, I''m pretty certain it doesn''t cheat.  The dialogue starts to repeat a lot after a while, but even now at over 28 hours played I occasionally get a piece I haven''t heard before.  I especially recommend it for when you''re feeling tired and a little fried but still want to play something - rather than some intense FPS or serious RTS game that takes actual concentration.'),
