accidentally dug a hole in the yard which led out into a boeing 747 jet in which I was put in a rear naked chokehold and put back in prison.
had to break up with one girlfriend.
made girlfriend pregnant and she birthed my beautiful fully clothed seven year old in the cell.
bashed a 4x4 and a screwdriver together until they turned into a key.
key was considered contraband.
got arrested.
as punishment they took away my leg.
made my way to hospital.
doctor offered me steroids for 5 dollars.
I said no.
doctor offered me new leg for 25 dollars.
I said yes.
reduced my sentence by doing a decent freethrow in basketball.
made friends with Sylvester Stallone.
did my time.
got out.
got run over by all vehicles.
