for some reason my doctor, Wrestling superstar Cody Rhodes and Alex Jones all hang out in my house.
for some reason Cody Rhodes follows me everywhere all the time.
I kill Alex Jones.
Donald Trump got very angry with me for ending Alex Jones and attacked me in the subway.
I barely made it out alive.
