a completely unrelated woman I haven''t seen before confesses her attraction to me and we instantly move together and become a couple.
I think she pregnant now.

10/10

THIS ALL HAPPENED IN THE SPAN OF FIVE HOURS!! THIS IS FROM NOW ON THE ONLY GAME!!!'),
