	 ('7974253','76561198017054986','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'Poker Night 2 is exactly what you expect it to be. It''s a poker simulator with colorful nerd culture icons and lots of humor to boot. The game includes a "tell" function just like the original, but the tells are subtle enough and have enough variability that they don''t outright break the game. Also, achievements in the game provide special DLC for Team Fortress 2 and Borderlands 2. No bugs to report and am very happy with the game considering the price.'),
	 ('174842177','76561197960337438','3009850','20251230',25,4,0,0,1,'This is the worst MDickie game by far, absolutely nothing interesting happens in this game.
Both original Hard Time versions had a schedule, you''d be called to things like dinner time, or yard time. This game has no schedule, you just walk around the boring prison without anything to do.

The camera sucks and will always randomly spin into a wall showing you absolutely nothing relevant all on it''s own. Absolutely nothing meaningful or fun happens via events, other than simple missions like "Deliver a baseball bat to North Block". 

Nobody will talk to you, unless you are in combat where people won''t shut the fuck up and constantly interrupt your fight. Their interruption takes your lock on off the person you''re fighting to the asshole talking over and over again until you''re dead, so you get to enjoy another 30 days of Hard Time. 

If you do anything remotely fun you''ll be gunned down and attacked by 20 guards with automatic firearms and RPGs.
This game isn''t funny bad like most MDickie games, this game has no redeeming qualities and is just that: bad.

To play this game is the Hard Time.

MDickie, this court has seen you accused of creating a bad game and heard your defense.
The trial has gone on quite long enough, so I''d like to take this moment to deliver my verdict..
I find you GUILTY and sentence you to 25 days in Southtown Correctional Facility!
That may not be a "long" time, but it will be HARD time! You''ll be lucky if you survive..'),
	 ('17473350','76561198025030865','386990','20251230',0,0,0,0,8,'The art in this game is beautiful, and the subject matter is very heavy, be warned if you get easiy bothered by heavy subject material. This is a good game to pass the time, not much action, so if you''re as horribe at games as I am this should be a breeze. I wish they let you make more choices, but there are choices that affect various situations. I recommend this game if you''re bored and just want to relax, and aren''t worried about being triggered by depression and related themes.'),
