	 ('8120178','76561198012646530','244070','20251230',3,0,0,0,10,'Excellent and simple little game.  The turn based mechanic makes it easy to play and the maneuvers, while far from realistic, lend a fun arcade like quality to the game.  Strategy and tactics are minimal which keeps the overall gameplay light and fun.  A great departure from the normal Sid Meier game concept.  If you want a real in-depth realistic WWI aviation game this isn''t it.  But if you want a fun to play little turn based game full of aviation eye-candy this is the one for you!'),
