	 ('54490660','76561198805886401','1086030','20251230',4,0,0,0,10,'Dating Life Miley X Emily is a very sweet mini story. Miley is a fairly new character to the Paradise Cove games while Dharker game veterans know Emily as the flirty business owner. The story itself is basically set over one night when Miley tries online dating but messes up her own profile. She is put on a date with Emily and they both agree to just go where the night takes them. There are 5 endings in total that you could probably get in about 3-4 hours. The Cg''s are very beautifully drawn and the dialogue is very unique and was fun to read for me personally. If you have never played a Dharker Studios game before and are considering trying one, This would be a good one to try.'),
