	 ('169399936','76561198150245790','234710','20251230',1,1,0,0,10,'As of July 2024 this game has been delisted from the Steam Store so most likely if you''re seeing this you already own the game and decided to check out the store page for some reason or you''re stalking my profile (either way, hi!).

