	 ('11875806','76561198023430257','234710','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'Fun just like the orignal, however these new TF2 items are now harder to earn, addtionally there are new charaters, sadly they don''t live up to the orignal charaters.

Pros:

1. You can now give your opponent''s drinks to make them easier to beat.
