	 ('49630714','76561198048962752','244070','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'A simple strategic game about the awesome WWI dogfight era, based on a really interesting concept that can evolve into a great sequel.

Choose a mission and engage your pilots into turn-based tactic aerial combat where you move your airplane to obtain an advantage position on your adversaries. 
Put into consideration altitude, airplane tilt, clouds, anti-aircraft guns to win a fight. Your pilots gain experience after each mission, they become stronger and can learn new maneuvers rightafter some wins.

Every mission will keep you busy for just 10-15 minutes. Missions are randomly given, so there is also campaign replayability.
Graphic menus, interface, backgrounds and replay feature are not extremely polished. This game is mainly focused on the gameplay experience. 

I hope the devs will consider developing a deeper and more serious sequel based on these great foundations.'),
