	 ('16047158','76561198034306697','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'[b]Another Poker Night game with a new set of characters. [i]Venture Bros in the earlier seasons[/i] Brock Samson, [i]Borderlands 2[/i] Claptrap, [i]Army of Darkness[/i] Ashley Williams, and Sam (& Max in the back) with GLaDOS dealing poker. [/b]

