	 ('233560','76561197966094624','234710','20251230',1,0,0,0,9,'Kickass game with awesome commentary by Brock Samson (Venture Bros.), Claptrap (Borderlands  2), Ash Williams (The Evil Dead), and Sam (Sam & Max), with dealer GLaDOS (Portal). Play either Texas Hold ''Em or Omaha style cards for a good time that is worth the cost!

