	 ('154614310','76561198956854473','584640','20251230',1,0,0,0,0,'Super Chicken Jumper is pure bs. The RNG in this game is a complete joke—half the time you die, it’s because the game decided to kill you. And instead of fixing the garbage RNG, they thought, ‘Hey, let’s throw in some poorly made weapons to make it better!". Spoiler: it doesn’t. It just makes the game even dumber because now you’re stuck relying on those useless pieces of $hit. The hitboxes are freaking garbage. The jump velocity is so g0ddamn slow you’ll die before you can dodge anything. The movement? Total a$$. When enemies or obstacles come from the right side of the screen, if you couldn''t shoot them dont even try to move back to try and dodge, because you WILL die.  And for some reason, they added this ugly-a$$ wiggle effect, probably thinking they were making some Hotline Miami wannabe $hit. But nah, it just looks terrible.

This game isn’t "difficult" because it’s challenging. It’s "difficult" because it’s a broken mess. It leans SO hard on RNG that you can’t do $hit about it. It’s not fun, it’s not fair—it’s just a steaming pile of doodoo.'),
