	 ('89865073','76561198049431444','234710','20251230',0,1,0,0,10,'Previously (a few years ago) I would''ve 100% told you to go buy this, as the characters are charming, fun, and the banter is great, and gameplay felt decently weighted towards you if you knew how to play. But coming back to it now to try to finish it, I''ve had so many plays where I have what looks like the winning hand, 97% or higher, only for them to manage winning at the last second, and it''s been more than a little irritating that the game has not only screwed me out of what was a great play, but at the same time, had all the characters make quips about how I suck. It''s not charming anymore, it''s insulting. I''ve either gotten rusty, or there''s been some patch to make the balancing worse, and honestly, it''s annoying. I vividly remember 4 years ago I could win 3/5 tournaments, with the fresh install I just had, I''ve won 0. I know Poker is 99% luck, but you''d think it would be less than a mental and physical grind just to unlock some weapons for TF2 and Borderlands.'),
