	 ('72139596','76561198427911257','73190','20251230',0,1,0,0,10,'Fun game, a lot like the Victoria series in it''s theme and concepts but in execution its a much deeper and interesting game. The turn based nature of the game may not be for everyone and if you''re one of those midwits who hate gameplay and love looking at green graphs while painting the map. The game is not AGEOD''s best but its definitely one of their most ambitious as it set out to cover much more than just warfare like their other classic titles. Definitely recommend, especially over the total garbage that Paradox is making now lol.'),
