	 ('153240914','76561199580367748','1410000','20251230',5,0,0,0,10,'I''m blown away with the realism of the physics in this game. I literally feel like I''m flying through the sky! I almost didn''t get this game because of all the negative reviews but I''m glad I did. It does say all new physics in the update so maybe the people that gave it a bad review tried the old one. Anyway here are my likes and dislikes.

