	 ('197257967','76561198425658860','2427430','20251230',8,1,0,0,2,'Pros:  
- Beautiful Ukrainian language,  
- Steam achievement system (although a bit tedious),  
- A little bit of graphics.

Cons:  
- A lot of textures got messed up and became worse than that of 2009,  
- UI elements positioning (or boxing) is broken,  
- Rare X-Ray crashes,  
- AI got much dumber,  
- A-Life hyper-activity,  
- Dialog options no longer indexed by 1-2-3 key line,  
- Ambient tracks are sometimes messed up,  
- Controls changed to less convenient,  
- Some console commands have become unavailable.

CRITICAL:  
- Save system broken.

I.E.: to make a manual save or to load a specific one you have to open the list of all saves. For some reason, doing so now takes O(n) time compared to O(C) in the 2009 version. Now you have to manage your save files manually via your local file system to avoid 5-10 min freezes.  

For example: after 5 hours of gameplay, it took me about 2 minutes to make a manual save file, during which the process is unresponsive. At 10 hours it became 5 minutes.  

That problem makes it almost unplayable for me. 


I hope this version of the game will not be forgotten and at least some issues will be fixed eventually.  
'),
