	 ('195260051','76561199497926702','2427430','20251230',139,33,0,0,9,'[h3]
Naturally, there is no optimization. The game from 2009 lags. Everything is soapy, although in the original there was no such soap. As always, you have to wait until the modders fix and finish the game for the developers.
Developers with headquarters in the Czech Republic, so proudly everywhere they write “made in ukraine”, have not done optimization, crashes from the game remained from the original, all the bugs also remained, the only thing they were able to do is to add a lighting mod, translate textures from Russian to Ukrainian and remove such inconvenient details such as references to Lenin, Soviet symbols and rubles as game currency. Russian voiceover cut and that crooked - if you turn on the Polish, then turn on the Russian and it will overlap already Polish. The feeling that this “Remaster” made for half an hour for a bottle of beer. Cut out the Russian voiceover. In the CIS 130 million people and all of them speak Russian, but they didnt just didnt do Russian voiceover, and cut out and so already ready. This is despite the fact that in all their interviews the developers themselves speak Russian. Most of the Ukrainians themselves also speak Russian. 
But the developers took some mods for lighting and 4K textures made by Russian-speaking modmakers, added them to the game and call this "Remaster". 
FACEPALM. They tried to remove Russian voice acting, but did not try to fix the bugs of 20 years ago. Clowns.
It is clear that modders will transfer the voiceover from the original game in 10 minutes, but this doesnt change the fact that the developers do the most disgusting. Politics have no place in games. 

P.S. It''s funny to watch how the developers delete all the topics in the discussions in Russian and all the mods with the return of Russian voice acting.

Instead of doing such nonsense and completely burying your reputation, it would be better to fix your games and fix the 20-year-old bugs.'),
