	 ('60365205','76561198078917558','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Okay, the fact this game is now unlisted breaks my heart. I play this game every Christmas / New Years Holiday; starting a few years ago. When I play this game, I drink beer and whiskey. I get drunk and have the best time of my life, no joke. I am drunk right now and I will be in the new year, or sooner. This game is the most important game over the holidays to me. 

Seeing Brock, Claptrap, Ash, Sam & Max, even that meanie Gladous, as well as Mad Moxie in the background is one of my favorite highlights. 

Also, Everyone was excited that Telltale is back and showed off Wolf Among us 2, don''t get me wrong that''s awesome; but it''s no Poker Night 3. I want to see Bigby play poker with Sam & Max.

and finally, bring Sam & Max back would ya?! I also play the three Sam & Max games I have every year. Those two just have the right charm that makes me feel great about myself. 

Anyway, I hope those who work at Telltale and those who use to work for Telltale know that I still play their older stuff and hope for their return! 

To end this review or whatever, I.''m a bit drunk and have a poker game with the coolest of characters on pause,  To everyone I hope your holidays are grand and I hope the year of 2020 is good for all of you! Sam & Max 2020?!?!?!?! Please ?!?!?!?!'),
