	 ('63593777','76561198048185878','1197770','20251230',0,0,0,0,6,'Quick review for what is a quick game.

1. Game is pretty short about 2-3 hours if you know what to do and when to do it.
2. While the graphics are good looking over all there are bits and pieces that look bad or just out of place.
3. The only good voice actors in the game are the voices of the Goddess, Lily, and Lola everyone else was lacking.
4. Writing could use some sprucing up in various place, mostly with the in between dialog, but isn''t bad.
5. The game doesn''t explain what the point of various mechanics are either until you are so far in the game that it doesn''t matter any more or not at all. (I still don''t know what the green vases do/did even having collected them all)
6. Lastly the best "scenes" are the ones between Lily and Lola as they actually try to sell the performance unlike the male voice(s?) do, but some of those other scenes can be fun or even funny.

Over all not bad for a small publisher you get what it says in the description and at the very least if you are just looking for something to get off to there is plenty in this game for that, only sticking point that really hurts the game is the full $20 USD price tag so maybe wait for a sale but again isn''t bad over all and did have some enjoyable moments in it.'),
