	 ('8270791','76561197982081903','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'if you''re a fan of the fandom and love some great juxtaposition, along with gambling, you''re not just a well rounded person you''re probably a fan of poker night! this game brings us the great game of texas hold em (and omaha if you''re into the variant of the game) and introduces us to some of the greatest characters anyone has ever fantasized shooting the breeze with. the amount of content (as far as the characters go) is staggering! not only can you also change the theme of the cards and table, but if you play your cards right, you can change the setting of the bar as well and even get the characters to comment on it! This game is great for anyone whose fans of the venture brothers, tall tell games, Portal or Bruce Campbell. there are a couple downsides....its not multiplayer and Mr. Campbell isnt actually facilitating his voice, but they found a great stand in and everyone else are the original voice actors. do yourself a favor and get this pass time game. you wont be disappointed!'),
