	 ('174122377','76561198066083401','2360290','20251230',2,0,0,0,5,'Fun for 3~ ish hours. Campaign mode has 5 levels at the time of this writing. Varied enemies. The game rewards pattern recognition skills. Crafting and selling is a minigame, not just click and sell, which is a unique take imho.

I bought it on sale for around 2€ which is fair. If you rush a lot, you could finish the game in less than 2 hours and refund it.

Small minus for lack of in-game explanation of terms like damage vs damage rating, functionality of defense, wether Dodge is % or rating based, no existing discord, no prestige function to create a gameplay loop that lasts longer. 

There is no controller support, keyboard and mouse plays fine though.

Has the feeling of being one of the first indie games that this dev did. Solid foundation here. Keep it up mr. Dev-Man'),
