	 ('69815277','76561197998144969','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'I know it''s not much - but it''s just fun. I like the characters, I like Hold''Em. There''s nothing super amazing about it - but it''s satisfying winning a game of Poker against the Freelance Police. When I was a young''un, Sierra used to make card/board game compilations that had their characters as players you could play against (Hoyle''s Book of Games) - and I played the heck out of that thing. And as you can see by the near 100 hours I''ve poured into this silly little game, I would probably continue to do so if any other franchise decided to make a card or board game with their characters. Quite enjoy.'),
