	 ('10005851','76561198078623630','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'This game is...well poker

Not much to say about the gameplay, it''s poker! if you have no ideer how to play poker, this could be a good way to learn it, or a game to stay away from.

Then why should you buy this game over the 100''s and 1000''s of other poker games out there? I will give some of you a good reason! The resason I say some of you, is becouse only some will love the tings you can win, and others will love the chareacters in the game.

You can play two types of hold''em in this game. There is Texas hold''em and Ohmaha hold''em. Both are the same type of poker, but the rules are a bit different.

The charecters in this game are hilarious, and they makes conversations, that will crack you up at times (if you have a good sence of humor :D).

The charecters are:
Sam from the game sereis Sam and Max. He get`s help from Max, who were in the last poker night game.
Brock Samson from The venture bros
Ash Williams from the Evil dead movie sereis
and Claptrap from boderlands 2
The dealer is GLaDOS from the portal sereis.

Now about the loot. No you can`t win or bet real money, but now and again the charecters throw in a special item, that will unlock skins and items for the games Team fortress 2 and borderlands 2

If you have these games, you will love to add them to your collection of skins and items. 

This game is really fun to play, and the dialog is the funiest aspect of the game. If you love poker, give this game a try. I give this game a thumps up. 7 out of 10'),
