	 ('11315774','76561198111378668','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'Poker Night 2. Such a wonderful game of banter between franchises with Sam''s bulky words and Max''s excitement for a good game of cards and Claptraps'' cease to bluff in times of dire need. Nonetheless I got what I expected out of this quality sequal and I applaud TellTale for their wonderful work on PN2 
Im hoping for more TF2 characters in Poker Night 3 hopefully and a games with a mix of all 3 set of characters but with different items.'),
