	 ('9867681','76561198109762804','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'I have always been careful not to be dragged into luck games for any computer or device, but I must say that when I saw some of my favorite caracters from video game and television universes, I had no choice but to take a chance with this game. To my suprise, I have already spent a couple of hours playing against these computerized foes, and I have loved every second of it. Each of their reactions and conversations towards each other keeps putting more icing on this metaphorical cake (No Pun Intended), and makes me want to come back for more. trying to read each of their cues can prove to be difficult, and in many cases, it feels like you are playing poker with some buddies on a friday night. 

