	 ('175495045','76561198074171814','3009850','20251230',0,0,0,0,4,'I played hard time 2 way back in the day, and I played Wrestling Empire somewhat recently and had a ton of fun with it. But this game is straight up not fun. It''s punishing and bullshit to the point in which I don''t even want to bother with the somewhat good fighting system that MDickie has made (which I know I enjoy because Wrestling Empire), because cops will just insta-arrest you the second they do a grab move with zero opportunity to fight back. Not to mention that you get wanted over the slightest infraction. I''ve gotten wanted for trying to get out of my cell right after wake up time happened. But the cops can just dive-bomb you out of nowhere and you just have to run away or you''ll be in the RNG court system.

It''s also way too buggy. Sometimes the camera will get fixed to something regardless of what you''re targeting and you are totally unable to look around, so you have to feel around for a door to fix it (got me killed twice).

Also the quests. The quests are 90% of the time awful. I''ve been tasked with getting items that do not exist in the prison, and I''ve been tasked for something to do at 8, to need it done by 12 that is impossible to get done in that time (loosing weight mission). You get quests shoved down your throat every single day that you didn''t ask for.

And one of the big things added was the town this time round. But the town is super bloated with areas I don''t care about (And swarming with cops if you''re an escapee). 

I just had the thought of "man this game sucks" while playing it come up again and again, when I really wanted to like this game.'),
