	 ('517561','76561197971433429','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,8,'While the character choice and actual dialog are far superior to the original, the random freezing in the middle of big hands, as well as the complete inability to skip previously seen dialog (and far worse, the seemingly interminable cut-scene style bits that crop up) makes this painful to play after a while. Pro-tip: Throw any poker experience you have out the window. Pre heads-up just overbet constantly to confuse the AI, and once it''s down to 2, raise any pre-flop hand you want to play to stave off the AI overbetting, and fold the rest.'),
