	 ('80758361','76561199048362870','3330','20251230',27,0,0,0,10,'Without any doubt, this is my number #1 childhood game! If I''m not wrong, it''s even the first game I''ve ever played on my first computer. Buying it on Steam, it brought me so much nostalgia and many funny memories. I used to play this game among with my whole family 13 years ago. I was the youngest member of the family, but one of the best at this game. This game used to be very hard for us, but now it was easy as a pie. I finished it in 2 hours with not many fails and I managed to complete the last level with 16 lives left. When I was a child, I could barely complete the last level after a lot of tries with only one life left and with a lot of frustration. I definitely recommend this awesome game to everyone!'),
