	 ('165108896','76561198368557037','3330','20251230',34,0,0,0,10,'This just brought back so many wholesome and fond memories. My mom is turning 70 tomorrow, on Mother''s Day, no less and it reminded me how much she loved this game back in the day. She have only played four games in her life—Solitaire, Pinball, Space Impact, and of course, Zuma Deluxe. She asked a tech guy to install games on her computer and out of all, this is her one and only favorite. She would play this for an hour on nights she wasn''t busy, it was like Candy Crush during her era. My mom played it, your mom probably played it, my friend''s mom played it, the friend of my friend''s mom played it, everyone was playing it and I don''t blame them, because it''s very enjoyable and challenging. I remember when she was doing one of those levels where there''s two skulls and the balls are a lot faster than they usually are, and it''s sometimes difficult to nail combos, it''s where I decided to bother her just for fun. She was on her last frog life so she failed but she didn''t get mad. Instead, she made it her mission to bother me whenever she finds out I am playing games LOL. Until this day when she comes over to visit sometimes, she still does it. Talking to me when I can''t even pause the game, like seriously!

Ah, so much nostalgia. Thank you for letting me reminisce the good ol'' days.'),
