	 ('201932278','76561199349582224','3330','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'Zuma Deluxe is an ancient yet worthy PC game classic from my childhood that still holds up to this day. Responsible for inventing the title-matching bubble shooter genre, this Mayan/Aztec theme puzzle shooter controls an orb-spitting frog who has to clear all the orbs in each layer of the temple or else it falls into the skull''s mouth. It''s fast-paced action and strategic thinking has you alert on your web feet as you carefully aim and fire at the right spots. Plus you can create sick chain combos by stacking 2 orbs of each color next to each other only to fire the 3rd orb in the middle to create unique combos. Overall, this Pop Cap computer arcade classic is a must play and it runs well on a Windows 10 laptop computer.'),
