	 ('185874739','76561199400979494','375460','20251230',0,1,0,0,10,'Either I''m a bad trader, or this is a simulator of an unprofitable business. Bandits attack always and everywhere. Even if you find profitable cities and villages, they stop being so after two or three turns. During this time, you will be robbed anyway, so do not worry.

