Here is idea number one - add more goods from the Middle Ages: iron, candles, weapons, alcohol such as wine or ale, medicinal herbs. In this style.
Here is idea number two - please make five to seven regions where local goods will be cheap. In the mountains - iron, in the south - food and alcohol, and so on.

I repeat that the idea is really good. But there is still a lot of necessary things to do.

I am extremely grateful to everyone who read this, and especially if you, dear developer, read it.'),
