	 ('41509439','76561197980689740','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Really not worth it. You won''t be able to just get the items in better games and then refund it, and it''s really only a time waster. The jokes are funny at first, but once you''ve heard them over and over without being able to skip any of them, it''s just annoying and interrupts the gameplay. Sometimes you just have to wait for a joke to play for a full minute or more until you can start playing again. The percentage chances that pop up during showdowns are unreliable, and the AI is subpar, as sometimes they will go all in with a pair of 2''s. Even the items in other games, which are admittedly pretty cool, are hard to obtain, as you have to go through 3 poker challenges between bounty items. You''ll want every other player at the table to be mercilessly lynched after hearing them talk for 5 minutes while not being able to play and seeing you have a 90% chance of winning, only to have Claptrap inexplicably get a flush at the last second. If you want the bounty items for other games, don''t plan on it being a quick endeavor or on being able to return the game. If you want to hear some funny lines from characters from popular games, this is a good game, but if you''re wanting to play poker, this probably isn''t it.'),
