	 ('82508328','76561198135540046','1115640','20251230',3,0,0,0,5,'作者非常无良，并且存在极为浪费时间的数值设计。修改攻略已经由其他评论写出，剧情和系统远远不如人在江湖，并且别个虽然难度更大，但是属于众多金庸mod里加入了宫崎英高风格的作品，整体而言成就感更高一些并且哪怕是吴亚古都不敢在金5里这拖慢节奏和堆砌这么繁杂的兑换模式，汉家松鼠和半瓶神仙醋均没有所谓的偷看别个妹纸洗澡100次达成任务这种无聊的设计。'),
	 ('187603547','76561198150389773','3330','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'This game is simple, but highly addictive and entertaining. Plus, it''ll run on a toaster - my Pentium II laptops can attest to this (I have an old copy I use to install to them). This game gets installed to any old computer I find, and I usually end up playing it then and there for a solid few hours.'),
	 ('48933464','76561198262452338','386990','20251230',2,0,0,0,8,'I read a lot of visual novels, and many of them are the same small set of tropes just repackaged in a slightly different manner.

Asphyxia however is more akin to real literature as it tries to paint realistic characters who you can identify with and relate to. I found both the comedy and drama to be very well written and very engaging. Could easily see myself in the protagonist.

Structure wise, there are 7 characters in the game and at least 4 routes to take with plenty of branching resulting in both good and bad ends.

Note that the game mostly deals with severe depression and low self-esteem, so if that''s not something you want to deal with you might want to steer clear. Otherwise, [b]HIGHLY RECOMMENDED[/b].'),
