	 ('23127792','76561198014978894','375460','20251230',0,1,0,0,10,'A poorly made trade sim with my pet peeve - poor language skills.
It''s "LOSE" guys - Not "Loose".
You LOSE time, money, goods etc.
you can NEVER loose something - except your bowels when you crap yourself.
Loose is a state of being not doing, it is not an action - the action is "Loosen" - You may loosen a rope that binds you, but you cannot loose it.
After playing the game for 12 hours with numerous restarts, I decided the game was pretty pointless.
Prices go down everywhere and travel costs and banditry pretty much screw any profit you make. Even from quests.
The idea behind the game is solid, and the interface is simple enough but if the spelling errors don''t get to you, the repetative price drops in pretty much everything will begin to annoy you over time.
What''s needed is something like a trade board which would assist you in deciding what to buy and where to travel - It wouldn''t have to be accurate, but an idea on where to travel with your goods for a potential profit would assist the gameplay greatly.
All in all, a pretty bad attempt at a good idea.
3/10 Dragons.'),
