	 ('16538584','76561198005946087','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'This is the perfect game for when you want to relax. Some of the lines get repetitive and the more you play the easier you figure out with the AI is doing. For the longest time I could only win matches here and there but you start to see some of the flaws in the AI and win more and more matches. The dialogue, before it starts to get repetitive, is fairly amusing and the back and forth between the different characters is good for at least a few laughs. Overall if you''re looking for a hardcore poker sim you should obviously look elsewhere however, if you are looking for something fun, quick, and and not too difficult, then I definitely recommend this game.'),
