	 ('33822536','76561197972040704','234710','20251230',2,1,0,0,10,'The first one bored me past the first hour. However, I actually like the characters better in this sequel than in the original...yet it still bored me at the hour mark. Why? The characters are funny and I like them, but they only say so much, and we''re just playing poker. I''ve played poker. It''s pretty decent, but I''d rather either play poker with people in real life, or play a more interesting video game, such as one including some of these characters where more fun stuff is happening, or watch shows/movies with some of these characters and have fun there. Basically, good characters have been sucked out of different settings and are funny together, but not as good as they would be in their own settings, and whatever they originally come from is better than this. This is just poker. =/

