	 ('7836960','76561198013026902','244070','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'This is basically a turn-based WWI air combat game.  A turn-based dogfighting game seemed a bit of a strange concept to me at first, and this game takes some getting used to, but it''s actually quite fun so far.  It''s proved to be harder than it seemed becasue there are so many moves the little planes can make (and I''m probably a lousy pilot too).  You also have to watch out for flak guns shooting up at you from the ground.  But as you gain victories and experience during the missions (strafing ground targets, shooting down balloons, dogfighting with enemy fighters, intercepting bombers, etc.) your pilots will get promoted and you can upgrade your aircraft.  I''m still learning the ropes, but it''s an amusing little game so far.  Definitely worth buying, especially if it''s on sale.  Have fun with it!  :)'),
