	 ('175388628','76561198002537057','3009850','20251230',14,20,0,0,0,'I spent lots of hard time trying to survive in the prison so i could get to the outside and enjoy my freedom. And after 36 agonizing days doing nothing but playing the robocop arcade in between lifting weights and beating the punching bag I finally got out. It felt like a miracle, my time had already been extended for shitting myself in the yard, charging me with defacation. As well as assault with a deadly weapon, a mighty toilet roll. Not to mention reckless driving in a wheelchair leaving scores of prisoners injured. I finally get to the suburbs and find my old home still standing there, as i go to sleep a buncha random people show up in my house. What happened next i couldnt believe, the Mat Dickie in the sky must have ordained civilian life is not for me, because as i went to bed again holding what must have been a bootled cambodian made iphone, it dropped and exploded and i was now wanted for Terrorism. I was promptly trialed and sent to 28 days in the pen. By chance i happened to find Mat Dickie''s character in the hospital and i had some more days added to my sentence after murdering him. This shit is some true hard fucking time.'),
