	 ('152479779','76561198205871151','3330','20251230',5,0,0,0,9,'I have a confession. On an old Windows 7 that I later had to factory reset, as part of a promotional thing PopCap did, I legally got Zuma Deluxe for free! So understandably, I looked to be as thrifty as possible when paying for it. I don''t remember for sure, but I think I got this game for just a dollar (and compared to when it first came out, I think at least the Steam release had a permanent price cut).

PROS:
The gameplay is solid, and I say that as someone who once (on the free browser version of Zuma) didn''t understand the point of the game and just shot balls randomly.
There''s more to it than I expected.

CONS:
