	 ('174953693','76561197999810037','3009850','20251230',2,1,0,0,1,'I played MDickie''s games back like, at least a decade and a half ago. Not much has changed, which is a disappointment. Unless you enjoy playing a game with a mishmash of senseless and broken mechanics, this game has nothing to offer other than a brief moment of enjoying the absurdity.

The controls are abysmal: arrow keys in TYOOL 2024? Having to toggle through focusing on characters? Interactions having movement as modifiers, exclusively? No ability to remap (as far as I could find).

Gameplay is offensively bad, especially after MDickie has worked on these games for decades. Random characters will come up and either tutorialize at you or give you impossible missions. These conversations don''t seem to be skippable either, and leave you with an annoying focus you have to hold to get out of (the hold is also not explained anywhere but through those random tutorializing dialogues). Nothing is explained, and most mechanics are hidden: hunger/thirst, if they even exist, have no meter; excess eating or drinking doesn''t seem to have any sort of visible warning; quests are random and impossible to complete sometimes.

Graphics are trash, but you can figure that out from the screenshots and is not even a big deal.'),
