	 ('114240630','76561197969062133','1148620','20251230',2,0,0,0,5,'A 2D action/adventure RPG where you play a pirate roaming the world, going on adventures at the behest of a cryptic old man. Explore dungeons, fight monsters, learn magic, evade deadly traps. It''s got an attribute and skill system that lets you make different builds, and is overall the kind of game you root for to succeed. Clearly a passion project, rough around the edges but with a great core idea. And absolutely, 100% not for me. I have no idea where I''m going most of the time, I die constantly, I can''t solve any puzzles, and I can never find whatever it is a quest needs me to find. That said, I am a low patience gamer who wants to be handheld and prefers my challenges to be very straightforward. But I know there are a lot of folks looking for games that provide a serious challenge and if that''s you, consider checking this out.'),
