	 ('122904475','76561198220522961','1107510','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Extremely simple to play, yet notably hard to master: the true mark of any great puzzle. Been playing Favo! on my phone for years as a time killer - and quite an addictive one at that, so purchasing Favo!+ here on Steam was a no-brainer. Same incredible gameplay loop, sweet soundtrack and a new game mode on top of that! If you want a quick, simple puzzle that can easily captivate your attention with time due to its constant decision making, give both mobile and PC releases a try. I''m quite sure you won''t regret it. Also, I''m happy to report that Favo!+ works on Linux via Proton, with a simple launch argument tweak!'),
	 ('174705148','76561199436239720','3009850','20251230',2,0,0,0,0,'•Every single camera angle option is just painfully brutal 
