	 ('36958936','76561198148080947','73190','20251230',9,0,0,0,0,'Not recommended. Very colorful, good music, and lots of historical research went into this game, but I have to agree with other negative reviews. Seems overly complex to manage, the units and facilities on the map are very difficult to find and to get a hold of. Moving troops seems to duplicate their image icon on the map (not a good idea!) with a start and finish location but try doing this with a few units in one province and you just loose track of what you are doing to whom. The game has a clunky feel to the entire UI, and it just seems too unusual to get used to. Finally, as has been said elsewhere, you must wait too long for turns to complete. I clocked over one minute and I was just starting the game. This is going to get worse as there will eventually be more and more happening with AI nations and units doing battles and moving around. Can not recommend it.'),
