	 ('125669307','76561198062546015','584640','20251230',9,0,0,0,1,'This review is directed to those who want to buy this solely for the co-op. (From the experience of two Dark Souls players)

Reconsider it. The difficulty spike of the first 10 minutes is disastrous. What seems like a fun game is stopped right in its tracks when there''s literal enemies SPAWNING right IN FRONT of the character with no telegraphing indication to dodge. Just imagine how frustrating it is to die repeatedly with your friend/family member repeatedly over and over with no idea why. And you just realize that they made the enemies be literally bullshit.

I''d play this solo. But this is way too stupid for a fun co-op experience. I wish I could refund this though, but I farmed cards off it.'),
