	 ('20475635','76561198115158556','234710','20251230',4,0,0,0,10,'6.9/10 - Improvement on the Original in all areas.

The first Poker Night really didn''t do it for me; it felt incomplete and way too easy! This one however improves everything and closes those gaps from the first.
If you like casual poker this is a good buy for $5.

This installment has tournaments, stats, achievements and some pretty fun gameplay. You can also use your earnings to purchase decks, chips and various table felts. 

It DOES get annoying listening to the competition banter. Sometimes they will go on for quite a bit and as far as I know you can''t skip it. It''s like trying too hard to be funny and create additional interest. 

Overall; this is a fun poker offering. Worth $5.

