	 ('94953294','76561198347791795','3330','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'I played this game so long ago. This was one of the first games i played as a kid. Its a really simple and fun game. You have colored balls and these balls move on a set path towards a hole. You have to destroy these balls before they reach the hole or you lose. Destroying them is easy. Just match the colors. 2 blue colors are moving towards the hole and you are about to fire a blue ball ? Well fire it at those 2 same colored balls and when you hit them they will explode. They have to be the same color tho if you fire a blue ball at 2 red balls nothing will happen cuz the colors are different. You match 3 balls that are the same color. The more you match, the more points you''ll get and the more balls you destroy the easier the level will be. After all balls are destroyed you''ll win. Its simple.

+Its a really fun, short game. Something you can play when you''re bored and there is nothing else you wanna do.
+It starts of really easy but it does get complicated as time goes on.

+/- No fullscreen support. When you do open fullscreen the resolution might be wrong. Its not really needed i think playing the game in fullscreen isn''t good playing it in a windowed screen is more fun and easier to use. For me this isn''t a huge problem but for others this could be a problem.

-The full price 10 Turkish Lira isn''t really worth it. I bought it in a 80% sale which was 2 Turkish Lira which is good enough for me. But again the full price is a bit too much.

