	 ('58816352','76561198105515904','1148620','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'After playing over 20 hours, it''s safe to say Plunder is a breath of fresh air in the world of modern gaming. If you''re looking for a game with great entertainment value, and one that you can play at your own pace and be pleasantly surprised with at every turn then give Plunder a try. What indie games lack for in AAA polish that make up for in abundance with passion, and Plunder is no exception. Challenging puzzles, fulfilling leveling up system, an impressively large open world, abundance of different weapons and enemies, catchy music, and whimsical writing all uniquely combine for a truly enjoyable experience.'),
