	 ('195639240','76561197968596923','2427430','20251230',11,0,0,0,1,'Not worth bothering with. They didn''t enhance anything. They didn''t even pay an artist to redesign the UI and just used an AI upscaler (which did a bad job). The only reason they released this edition is to get rid of all the old Soviet symbols in the game, remove the Russian language (which started the Ukrainian civil war back in 2014, btw) and rewrite history.'),
	 ('113857265','76561198873191062','584640','20251230',4,0,0,0,9,'The game is really fun to play, and i get why a lot of people complained about the RNG being whack (it is not rare for the game to generate impossible scenarios, especally in the first world, where you dont have any upgrades yet), but since the levels are so short, i always just tried one more time, until i could beat the level. Center of the Earth (Last World) is hard, but it is definetly beatable, especially with the upgrades you can get.

Only problem i have with the game is the lacking content. The challenges are really fun, and there are 30 of them, but after that, what can you do? Endless mode, and that''s it. I don''t know what i could expect though, since this game is basically an endless runner with a set end to levels, basically a "glorified" google dino game, like "dino run DX".'),
