	 ('183477052','76561198380582858','3330','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'Zuma is a classic Popcap Game where a Frog(i belive) tries to stop balls from reaching a skull

Gamplay:
Zuma gameplay is simpel but fun if you press the Left Mouse the Frog will shoot a ball match 3 or more of them to make them dissapera!
You hold 2 balls at a time switch between them using the Right Mouse
The Goal is to make all the balls disapear befor they touch the skull then you will move on to the next level
(there also special balls when broken give you abilities or do something)

Art Style:
Zuma art stly is a bit nostilgic for me idk why but it really good for a game in the 2006

Audio(Music&Sounds):
Zuma doesnt really have alot of tracks the ones it does have are fine not something i would listing in my free time tho
But the Sounds Are so funny XD like iga biga zuma i really love the sound desing

Story:I dont think Zuma has a story(atleast the first entry)

Length:
The Game isnt really long it will take the avarage persone 3-5 hours to complete it but its fine

Price:
The Price is alright i would honstley dcharge 3 dollars for it but 5 is still okay

Rating:
Gamplay:7.5/10
Art Stly:8.5/10
Audio:
(Music):5.5/10
(Sound):10/10
Story:not rating

Final Verdict:Zuma is fun and short game which i would defently say you should try out!'),
