	 ('59400398','76561198163443179','1197770','20251230',96,9,0,0,10,'Lilly Knight is the next level in adult gaming on Steam because we all know that the majority of adult games here are visual novels and picture tile swapping puzzle games. The developers have raised the level bar of the adult games once again (they''ve done before with Mandy''s Room 2) .

This is the way they are meant to be done. 

The story is simple and linear, but you need to find by yourself some secret chests in each of the three cities and you need to do that without any map to help you out.

There are a few things I like how they implemented in the game: 
The secret chests contain "documents" of new sex positions that the character can use. 
The save game statue is actually a kiss with a fairy. 
The dialogue is modern even the action takes place in some sort of medieval village.
The environment is very well done and the NPCs look great.
... and of course...Lilly has beautiful pointy breasts :)

I recommend the game to anyone who liked Mandy (the character), and whoever has found this game first. These developers need to be supported because at this moment they seem to be the only ones who can actually change the face of this gaming niche.'),
