	 ('119632789','76561198450345569','840930','20251230',4,0,0,0,9,'i review games on steam after i 100% complete them! check out my reviews to see all the games i have completed!

bing bong XL is a arcade-style game developed by adamvision studios released in 2018 when they released this game and two others (pivot XL and righty tighty XL) all at once. they all have the same aesthetics and feel/play similar to previous adamvision games. this game in particular features one button that makes you slow down as you go back and forth across the screen, avoiding objects by slowing down to avoid them as they also cross across the screen horizontally (you go across vertically). it''s much easier than adamvision studios previous games like bit blaster XL, orbt XL, and diamo XL as it took me about an hour to get all the achievements. i think this game is a bit harder than pivot/righty tighty XL but not in a good way. some runs ended in ways that i would deem "cheap" but that''s probably just me being salty. overall, this game is another solid entry from adamvision, as they make some of the best arcade-style/high-score chasing games and i can''t wait to more of the games in their portfolio.'),
