- with iconic characters such as Claptrap, Brock Samson, Ash Williams and Sam, who constantly keep chatting and entertain you in each and every situation

[b]And all of the above include:[/b]

- an overall incredible atmosphere

- fun cinematics at certain points

- achievements to achieve [i](see what i did there?)[/i]

- bounties to collect [i](personal items belonging to the characters)[/i]

- the ability to purchase drinks for the other players to find their "tells" and speculate potential bluffs

[b]- AND MANY OTHER THINGS![/b]

For "a simple poker game", this one has it all, at least in my view. [b]THEY NAILED IT![/b]

What more could you ask for? Seriously...i dare you to ask for more!

[b]10/10 - Would be humiliated by GLaDOS''s sarcasm AGAIN! <3[/b]'),
