	 ('175418952','76561198148666688','3009850','20251230',3,0,0,0,0,'As a long time fan of MDickie games I gotta say this just ain''t it, especially compared to the original Hard Time. You''ll constantly be barraged by people talking to you about meaningless crap without anyway to just not talk to them or them giving you demands disguised as "favors" without any ability to say no on your part. You''ll be attacked endlessly by other prisoners and guards without them ever getting in trouble for it, in some cases, literally killing your character; then if you have the gall to try and defend yourself you''ll be in court for assault, that is if them attacking you just doesn''t make them come after you for assault even when you never hit them. If you''re lucky enough to survive your health depleting to 0 and get sent to the hospital it won''t matter cause the staff/guards there will just attack you while your down anyways, insuring your death. You''ll be put in a cell with 2, 3, even sometimes 4 other cellmates who will no doubt, like other prisoners, will attack you in the night without warning making your small cell a thunder dome where you have to fight for your life; all while praying that the guards don''t see you cause they''ll prosecute you but not them. This game is just a exercise in how much abuse you can take before you snap and go on a killing rampage taking out your pent up rage on everyone that crosses you which is about the most fun you''ll have, that is until someone talks to you mid shooting which forces you to switch target to them which makes you have to go through the painful process of having to cycle through everyone in view until you lock back on to your intended target. This game as is, is just not fun to play and will only serve to make you upset; i know there is more to it once you get out and even play as a guard yourself if you can get out of prison; but with everything stated above with failing favors you never asked for or going to court your sentence will just compound. I know other MDickie games have similar issues but in this it is just too much and makes it all together rage inducing, unless you just wanna go wild and see how many people you can take out before getting a death sentence or just have a pension for machocism, i don''t recommend playing this.'),
