	 ('96763467','76561197968762953','1197770','20251230',5,0,0,0,10,'It it seems that with all lewd games either the game part or the sex part is not very good for various reasons and this game is no different. If you are here for the sex you will not be disappointed. The models are hot without venturing too far into the creepy uncanny valley and the sexual encounters are mightily fap worthy. I like the interactive elements in the sex scenes but they can be hard to manage with one hand. ;) i The star of the show here is the voice acting by Mia Sloane, she really sells it and much of the games charm is due to her efforts.  The game part itself is a very repetitive fight cycle, but at least the monster models are detailed and interesting. The animations for everything except the sex scenes are barely passing. The environments are in the WOW vein of fantasy lite but get very same-y very quickly. The secondary element responsible for the game''s charm after our main character''s voice is the dialogue. There is some funny and clever stuff here if you can get through the weak game play elements. If you come for the fap and have patience enough to get through the low parts between sex scenes you will enjoy, just don''t expect much game here.'),
