	 ('174829570','76561198096326551','3009850','20251230',6,0,0,0,10,'This is Mat''s most important game.  I''ve waited a long time for Hard Time III.  Instant buy.  Grand Theft Auto VI can take forever to come out now.  Release this again on playstation and i''ll buy it again on playstation!
--
My story and Post-Honeymoon review:
I picked Luke Answer at random and spent last night speed running Luke’s hard time (29 day sentence) to unlock the game Editor.  Now that I have, I plan to meticulously recreate all the protagonists from the Grand Theft Auto universe in this one world, probably over the next week.  

I had 3 days added to my original 26 day sentence-- it temporarily reduced by 1 day, then that decision was reversed-- before I buckled down on serving my time as quietly as possible.  Despite trying to hide, I still managed to romance and have a baby with a woman in the Library (not sure her name; she violently gave birth and told me it was my kid which freaked me out and I never returned to the Library after, since that is where she and the baby stayed; all I remember is she wore a green outfit from the East cell block.

After my release, I looked at the world map and… it is big! I managed to get to the suburbs and to my house before a guy backed into me with a van while I was riding a bike. The accident cut off hand.  I was offered a ride to the hospital which I took hoping to get a new hand or something, but the surgeon ripped me off and I didn’t get any better after surgery, dying shortly after.  Oh well, Editor unlocked.  

Final thoughts: [b]I hope Hard Time III gets the same love as Wrestling Empire did, with a beefing-up of the game engine over time.  I particularly would like more interactions with props and game world objects[/b].  All in all, a solid addition to MDickie''s lineup.'),
