	 ('1446509','76561197993323455','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'The dialog is good and the poker gameplay can be fun and very challenging, But this game lacks the options of the first version to turn off voices if you get bored of them. And at time of writing has a real tendency to bug out, missing characters or semi-corrupting save/preference files.
