	 ('54384951','76561197994341977','244070','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'Read reviews and saw several mentioning constant crashes, but I decided to try it anyway since it was 75% off and less than $2.00 for the bundle of Ace Patrol and Pacific Skies. Played for about 1.5 hours total of both games, then requested a refund because it kept crashing. My gameplay experience was essentially this:

