	 ('192660057','76561198017220746','3009850','20251230',8,2,0,0,0,'Played the OG Hard Time when I was a kid, now I''m pushing thirty and here I am again, playing Hard Time. It''s ridiculous how chaotic and strange the game can be, but that''s the pull of it, there''s just so much random stuff that can happen that it guarantees you''ll never be bored.

My first playthrough, arrived in prison, went to the restrooms, saw an inmate beating the everliving shit out of a police officer with a pipe. He pauses, walks up to me, and tells me that I need the pipe more then he does and hands it to me. I hit the officer on the ground one time, which results in him dying.

I get arrested for murder as soon as I walk out into the hall, I lose the court, and my sentence? They chop off my leg. (I am not joking). My character is now one legged, but my reputation went up to 99%, inmates just hand me random stuff and talk to me like I''m a god.

Buy the game, create your own dumb but funny stories.'),
