	 ('12699072','76561197988749956','234710','20251230',4,0,0,0,9,'I bought this on the many glowing reviews I read of the game, and can''t for the life of me figure out why any of them were posted lol.  This game is incredibly shallow, and is filled to the brim with repetitive, unskippable dialogue.  It''s also quite shallow in terms of unlocks and game modes to explore.

