	 ('13782004','76561198039561959','244070','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'I was keeping an eye for this for some time, but the price didnt seem worth it.
Finally picked it up on sale and its worth some 2-5 euros. 
Its a good casual game, but expect nothing more.

PROs
+ Good idea using turnbased manouvers to simulate air combat
+ ouflanking/manouvering your opponents is satisfying
+ allows you some freedom to choose your strategy/approach for an air-battle and playing it out is fun

CONs
- gets repetetive very quickly - the missions are the same (destroy plane/land target) without any story behind, few planes, not much replay value even for other nations (4 altogether)
- basic graphics
- with better execution, some story, better RPG elements and a more varied campaign this game could have been so much more

Perfect for a lazy evening chill, not much else'),
