The options are very limited, you can only move in the direction of the headset, not using the left controller (which is what I do in every other game I play).
Your character has no presence in the game, not even hands, just two floating Vive controllers.
When collecting audio logs you have to stand by them and listen to the whole thing for it to register as being collected.
Sometimes when getting in and out of the vehicle it would teleport me high into the sky and drop me into the middle of nowhere making have to restart the game.
Female protagonist.
Maybe if I didn''t have to deal with all that I might have finished the game, or maybe not, it wasn''t that interesting to me.'),
