	 ('128738957','76561197982507242','3330','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'This is a fun mouse-only, single-screen, colored ball, shooter style game that takes between 30 seconds and 5 minutes to clear a screen.  The balls follow a pre-defined curved path that snakes and loops across the screen.  Shooting a distant loop through a gap is a fun challenge as are shooting coins which require careful color coded shooting and timing to hit them.  The background music is actually pretty good, sets the mood and is not obtrusive.  The game tracks your best time and presents that at the scoring screen along with the "Ace" time which gives you a reminder and challenge even on replays. Overall the game is fun diversion that can find you wondering how it got to be 2AM when clearly it was you thinking "just one more level".'),
