	 ('200588446','76561198291893269','3411440','20251230',11,0,0,0,10,'I mained Tung Tung Tung Tung Tung Sahur, 420 No-Scoped a noob, and got jumpscared by a j*b application.. 10/10, best kart racer since Garfield Kart, the moment this gets a page on Speedrun.com, I''m coming for #1.

