	 ('23128054','76561198121927012','234710','20251230',5,2,0,0,10,'My gambling adventure continues on this game..... I remember the days of playing with The Heavy, Strong Bad, Tycho, and Max at The Inventory..... Ahhhhh good guys to play poker with...... (OH WAIT Max is back.... for the conversations xD)

