	 ('139280951','76561199361483588','3330','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'[i]Zuma[/i] is tough but fun. It plays similarly to Taito''s classic bubble-blasting game [i]Bust-a-Move[/i] but with the added challenge of your target being constantly moving. You''ll find it can easily get out-of-hand with just a few wrong moves, but you shouldn''t get frustrated since it''s fair to you as a player and since your constantly improving technique will help you regain lost progress quickly.'),
