'),
	 ('155570195','76561198053568113','840930','20251230',4,0,0,0,9,'Bing Bong XL is a one button arcade action game in which you have to slow down the ball to avoid obstacles. The ball moves by itself and all you can do is slow it down to avoid obstacles. This makes for a pretty frustrating experience in some scenarios, because when you can''t control your character properly well, you die obviously. It takes quite a bit of skill to get around 100 points!

I think the game only has one song, but it''s good at least. The graphics and sound effects are pretty minimalist and you have a few balls to unlock to make the grind to a higher score a little more enjoyable.

At $1 it''s hard not to recommend it. The game is addictive and you always want to reach that higher score, so it''s got that kind of drive. I''d say it''s worth buying.'),
	 ('8615834','76561198035995399','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'The game is a little glitchy, and after a while, you''ve heard all the charming things that all the different characters have to say. With that said, the game is a very entertaining poker sim. You play cards with some of the greatest characters in geek media, and you can win a Space Core. Who doesn''t want to win a Space Core? No one that I want to spend time with, that''s sure.'),
	 ('54128147','76561198154738626','1115640','20251230',2,1,0,0,10,'武当咸鱼前来写个英文评测（会附带中文版）
