	 ('39665907','76561197984448527','500670','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'While it may seem pretty basic at first, this is a fun and addictive arcade style twin stick shooter. Trying to get new high scores and compete is great, and so is learning how the bosses and upgrades work. I''d recommend avoiding guides when you first get into the game, as discovery is part of the fun and challenge. 

I should probably say something about the obscenity level in the game. There''s no denying that it is over the top gory, and the player character frequently shouts profanities. Again, it''s over the top and obviously by design, but if you''re not into something like that you will probably not enjoy this game. 

For me, this has been the best arcade style "one more game" type game I''ve played on Steam in a very long time. I still haven''t cleared out all the bosses, and will keep playing at least until I do. If that sounds interesting to you, I strongly recommend it.'),
