-2tbsp olive oil
-1 largeonion
-2 minced garlic cloves
-2lbs ground beef
-1 can diced tomatoes
-2 cans tomato sauce
-2 cups water
-Spaghetti
-Seasonings

Heat oil in large pot. Add onions and garlic and cook for 2 minutes. Add ground beef and cook until completely brown. Add tomatoes, paste, water, parsley, italian seasoning, salt, pepper, sugar, and any other seasonings you enjoy. Mix thoroughly. Let come to a boil and then turn down heat to a simmer. Let simmer at low heat for at least one hour. If it becomes too thick you made add a little water as needed. That''s it. Serve over your favorite pasta and your done.
