People are complaining that this game is missing features, mainly in schedules, but so much other shit is thrown at you in this that those schedules would have been impossible. There are improvements to camera control (on pad) and some improved interactions with other characters, but the prison map itself seems very small. It''s nice having all these other spaces on the map but most of them don''t seem to serve a purpose.

