	 ('166232322','76561198281215729','3330','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'This game is a «hardcore arcade»: despite the simplicity of its concept, it requires high precision and quick reactions, especially in the later levels. Players need to carefully plan their actions and predict the trajectory of the balls to successfully complete the level.

