	 ('13287370','76561198006600581','234710','20251230',2,0,0,0,10,'I went looking for a poker game so I could brush up a bit and I found this. Saw this on sale and picked it up. Telltale put together a great little game here with solid poker. You play with a ragtag cast of copywritten characters; Brock Sampson, Ash Williams, Sam and Max, and Claptrap. Who is the dealer you might ask? Oh... it''s just GLaDOS from Portal. Hosted by a strange British man in a captain''s hat and a Hugh Hefner robe.

The Poker gaming is really fun and pretty easy to learn if you need to. The only negative experience is that there''s only so much dialogue and character chatter. After playing for a while you might get a bit annoyed. I happen to like most of the banter and sometimes hear something new every now and again. Regardless, a very solid and to the point poker game.

