	 ('62096158','76561198022667546','1197770','20251230',18,2,0,0,10,'I''m gonna be generous and give this game a recommendation but with a lot of asterisks.

(1) Know that this is mostly a porn walking simulator. It is barely a game. Combat mechanics are a no brainer, quick response/turn-base with only 2 attacks and a heal, no attack type, no stats. So, don''t expect any interesting gameplay at all.

(2) There is very little replayability. The game is a single railway map from point A to B where each map is very small, barely a hundred meters in game wise. So there''s not gonna be much exploration/discovery.

(3) It is expensive. I got another indie game 1/2 the price of this one and spent 30+ hours of game play on it while I completed this is just about 4 hours. And I was taking my time. People who rush this could complete it in just over an hour. So value per hour is not really there and I suggest waiting on a discount.

But it is still an ok porn. You''re getting an ENF simulator which is pretty rare. Voice acting, primarily the female main actress, is really great. Most porn games are text base so having a dedicated VA is really rare and really adds to the fantasy/immersion.

We don''t get a lot of good adult games in the first place and this is one of the better quality ones. So if you want to show your support for adult games, give this one a try.'),
