	 ('75023738','76561197980796094','234710','20251230',2,0,0,0,9,'Poker Night at the Inventory 2 is still a fun game after 7 years. It features Texas Hold ''Em and Omaha, unlockable decks, tables and decorations, as well as a trophy hunt. The cast is somewhat strange, and I had to look up, who Brock is. The characters interact in mostly funny ways, and simulate "real" poker game banter between them. Some commentaries get repetitive quite quick. The Poker game itself seems somewhat competent. I regularly install this once a year, play a few rounds for 2h of poker fun and then forget it again, until the urge to poker comes up again.

