	 ('61936670','76561197995317130','1197770','20251230',9,2,0,0,10,'This game is amazing. It''s different than other "games" with sexual content. Most other games are simulations, dating apps, slide shows or text adventures. Lilly Knight earns its right to be called the first actual game of its kind. Maybe it deserves a new genre. There are multiple gameplay dynamics that are permeated with sexual passion. There is a progression from shy but interesting to steaming hot. If you like sexual content, this is the next step of gaming.

I think it''s worth considering to support the developers not because the game is worth it after substracting pros and cons, but because they should be encouraged to produce more and even better games like this.

The game has its problems. But the developers care about the community and offer options to circumnavigate around the bugs and difficulties. The game is short but very enjoyable.'),
