	 ('2733486','76561198011807830','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,4,'You know the trope "The Computer''s a Cheating Bastard"? The coms know their final hand before it''s even been dealt. No, seriously, they know the end result and will happily go all in for a straight they''ve no hint of obtaining until the last few cards are laid on the table.

