	 ('200168468','76561198089196080','3330','20251230',1,0,0,0,4,'[quote=author][b]Reviewed at hour 6 with 100% achievements completion.[/b][/quote]
[code][i]But don''t let the hours fool you—I’ve probably dropped 300+ hours on this as a kid 😂[/i][/code]
[hr][/hr]While browsing the store for something to play, I was surprised—[b]Zuma Deluxe[/b] was actually available here. Insta-buy. No hesitation. The nostalgia alone was worth the price.

[b]Zuma Deluxe[/b] is one of those games that’s just cemented into my childhood. It was my dad’s favorite back then and man... he was addicted to this—[i]and he was colorblind too![/i]

I still remember watching him unlock the [spoiler]Space[/spoiler] level, just glued to the screen until he finally cleared it. Core memory. Back then, it took me forever to finish the game. Small hands, tiny brain—haha.

Playing it again now as an adult… [b]Yeah, it’s actually not that hard. [/b]But it still has that same magic.

This game will suck hours out of your day without you even noticing. The [b]colors of the marbles[/b] mess with your sense of time. Seriously.
[quote=author]For a mechanic as simple as this, this was a joy to play.[/quote]'),
