	 ('142125372','76561198041136706','1661180','20251230',0,0,0,0,3,'Passable game I decided to not recommend. Content of the game is very limited, you can finish campaign in less than three hours, leaving you with "skirmish" maps. The idea is good, but there is just not enough content - 7 buildings, of which 4 you will be building just on the main planet. 

Generally you will cover all planets with solar panels and extractors. You will do the same with main planet, but then add few farms and domes and research center (no, there is no research in the game, it is just condition to finish mission). And thats all, game over. The UI is not exactly effective, resources are hard to see. 

Not terrible game and might appeal to casual gamer, but thats it. The fact that only 5.5 percent of players finished (3 hours) campaign is quite indicative.'),
