	 ('9342242','76561198026737316','244070','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'I was quite surprise to find this game similar to one the classic turn base games called Battle of Britain. Its almost similar. And its cheap and fun as well.

You start of as one the pilot where you get to choose anyone of the four. And each one comes with a talent. As the mission progress, you have more pilots up to 4 and each pilots will gain different abilities where you can choose. Over the time and missions that you win and completed, your planes will be upgraded and modifications will be made to the plane where you can choose and also the different abilities like roll over, ace skills for your pilots.

This is a turn base battle where you will plan your planes flight to engage or complete the missions. Music is good, graphics pretty cute.

Overall I find this quite fun, if you love some rpg, strategy and turnbase battle, try this one out you will be surprise what you find in this game, not for hardcore strategy lovers. More fore casual or some rpy strategy lovers. Besides its battle of the world war 2 planes.

8/10 (Some role playing elements and strategy combination and user friendly controls make it a hit)


