	 ('5204473','76561198046363336','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Poker Night 2 is a great step up from the first Poker Night. First, there''s more game variety. You have the Texas Hold''em from the first game, but you also have Omaha Hold''em this time. The characters are new and the dialogue is very improved and much funnier. There are also many things to unlock, so even if you did unlock all of the tf2/borderlands items, there is still much you can unlock for Poker Night 2, whereas Poker Night was pretty much a game to finish for the unlocks and never play again. There is no difficulty setting and the players are kinda difficult at times, which makes the replayability much better than the first game.

Overall, Poker Night 2 is a solid-built game, a great addition by Telltale Games, and the rewards for playing in different styles are very good and plenty. Poker Night 2 receives an 8/10 from me.'),
