	 ('20195890','76561198002931093','234710','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'I don''t know how to play Poker, yet I keep coming back here. That''s the best thing I can say about this game. Even if you are just interested in the characters, you can just fail and watch them play and interact. Sadly, they don''t have that much to say to each other. You''ll probably end up hearing all the dialogues in just a few games. But still the entire experience is very polished, entertaining and fun. If I knew how to play poker, I''d be all over this. But the thing is that I don''t and I keep coming back to The Inventory. That''s why I''m recommending "Poker Night 2".'),
