	 ('110724552','76561198035334313','1712690','20251230',6,3,0,0,10,'If you''re looking for a fun game to play with your friends that you don''t have to take too seriously. Look no further!

As the description tells you, this is an early access CCC game. A game where you and your friends can have a lot of fun trying to pilot a ship on land, ram each other with a car and have fun with the ragdoll animations of your opponents.
But you can also progress through the story, fight bosses and collect loot and rare items.
You also have the opportunity to explore a lot, especially in the first world. 

You will encounter glitches and bugs, but they are part of the fun.

I strongly recommend playing the game in multiplayer and not solo. The enemies don''t scale accordingly and you will have an easier time if you play with someone else. 

Finally, I would like to give one piece of advice: Being sober while playing is completely optional!'),
