	 ('30843837','76561198079754352','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Having earned all of the achievements in this game, I can properly say that I now know how to play poker. This is a great teacher for anyone looking to learn how to play the card game, just be prepared for a lot of insults from everyone at the table, and a lot of losing that is out of your control. The jokes are incredibly funny and creative in the beginning, but slowly become stale after playing the game for more than a day. The game is one of the best teachers for learning how to play poker, and makes learning it enjoyable. Be warned that the game tries its best to teach you the basics, but the only true way you learn how play poker well is through trial and error. I was skeptical of actually learning how to play poker in the beginning, but now I beat many of my friends in real life poker.  8/10'),
