	 ('9341517','76561198020999870','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Poker Night 2 is not a game you can put 8 hours a day for months into. Its a fun poker sim which aims to emulate the banter and party atmosphere of a game of poker with friends. It suceeds at this admirably, the writing and voice acting is superb, where else will you find Glados, Claptrap, Ash and Sam and Max in one game mocking your ability to bluff. There are two flavoures of poker on offer, Texas Hold''em and Omaha, the tutorials for both are more than capable for total begginners or if, like me, you''re a bit rusty. It won''t last you long but if you can pick this up for cheap its a few hours of good entertainment'),
