	 ('87207194','76561197982803321','244070','20251230',0,0,0,0,9,'If there''s a bad Sid Meier game I can''t think of it, and it certainly isn''t this one.  Ace Patrol isn''t a big, epic experience that''ll eat a week of your life like Civilization.  It''s much more a beer and pretzels type game.  You can finish a dogfight in 10 minutes.  A whole campaign will take you an evening.  But there are lots of elements here to like.  Career progression for your pilots, improving aircraft over the course of the war, varied mission choices.  It''s a turn based dogfight game where your pilots have access to certain maneuvers and you play them out.  As a pilot gains experience he/she has access to trickier more complicated maneuvers and there is a definite difference between a rookie and a veteran.  All and all a neat little simulation of WWI aerial combat.

One big caveat... it will crash like crazy under windows 10 unless you run it in compatibility mode.  I had to set it to Windows 7 SP3 and once I did it worked without a hitch.'),
