	 ('197563473','76561198315686960','3596030','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'Even with some issues at first, I kept relaunching the game.
As the developer is very responsive, we immediately got updates upon our feedback.
The game is quite nice.

You have 6 faces to play with, each having their own skill.
You combine these with a flag of which you have 6 to choose from. Every flag has a feature, for example consuming a special tile for a points multiplier.
You can play on 4 board sizes.

At the end of a successful board, you can buy perks like shields, point boosters, glass tiles and so on to make next runs a bit more comfortable.

There''s also a nice in-game overview for the achievements.

I played without music as I found the loop a bit too short and so repetitive but it is quite nice just playing with the sound effects. Sounds can be modified in steps of 25%.

Minesweeper with benefits. Who can resist that?'),
