	 ('184061312','76561198866732642','3009850','20251230',1,0,0,0,10,'Really, really disappointed with this product. Had to refund same day I bought it, cuz the game just... Would not work. I was able to play for 3 hours, had to leave, and then the next time I launched the game, the "Play" and "Options" buttons on the menu would crash the game. I didn''t pay 10 bucks for a menu simulator. 

If this is a common bug with a fix, or can get patched, I''ll resign my negative review, because I loved the game otherwise. But as it stands right now, it is, quite literally, unplayable. Good luck to anyone else who bought the game.

Revision: I TAKE IT ALL BACK. Game is working great again. For all those wondering, as well, I found out the problem. If you''re using a controller when the glitch I detailed above is happening, it means your calibration has been messed up. Try to access the options menu using PC controls ONLY, recalibrate your controller, and then everything works fine. If things still don''t work for you... I dunno, sorry. :0 Excellent game, very fun, 10/10.'),
