	 ('195322813','76561198050442170','2427430','20251230',4,1,0,0,10,'CoP is my favorite of the original trilogy. What people are saying about censorship is true, however, its not entirely noticeable. NPC''s are speaking a different language all the time when language is set to English and theres no subtitles. Still lots of immersion as usual. It''s not strictly one language like Stalker 2 is (sad panda). The only people that care are super nit-picky, I couldn''t be bothered. 

Another thing people are crying about is the text font changes. THE FONT.... I don''t think I need to explain how ridiculous that is. 

The textures have gotten a decent upgrade in SOME areas, although looking closely the grass is in fact slightly blurry. But only when I''m aiming my sights directly down on it. But it does look like they used some kind of "all in one" up-scalar for re-texturing the entire game and called it a day, which is very lazy. It''s painfully obvious... 

That said, some of the good are the sky-boxes have improved their photo-realistic aesthetic, and the grass/foliage draw-distance has been dramatically improved. In the original you would see vegetation appear right before your eyes everywhere you went within 20 feet of you. It''s not perfect, as the shadows pop in instead now, but its still much better and real noticeable. This alone makes the game look a lot better than the original. Screen-space/water reflections have been noticeably improved as well. 

Shadows are also much more pronounced with clouds passing by and seeing the shadows pass on the ground with all the foliage in conjunction with the wind and mutants running in the background makes for additional immersion I would get when playing CoP. 

The negative reviews are talking about politics, and the other 80% need glasses because they cannot see the game. Their age must be showing..... As far as talking about how fun the actual game is, it''s just as I remember, but I''m not sure why it exists as there''s not too much difference besides a few things and with a slight graphical improvement over the original.

Its the CoP you know and love but its a very very lazy remaster/enhanced/redux whatever you want to call it. Just doesn''t really earn the title of one.'),
