	 ('40350973','76561198193333433','234710','20251230',0,0,0,0,10,'Poker Night 2 is a underrated game. When I first got this game, I thought it was going to be hard and not as fun as I pictured, but if you go over the tutorial for a bit, I''m sure you''ll have positive money. But I''ll get straight into the pros and cons.

[b] PROS 	[/b]

- Can win items for other games

- Very modern, chilled out

- A lot of talking 

- Customizability

- Makes poker even more fun



[b] CONS 	[/b]

- Sometimes too much talking so you can''t pick a card

- If you aren''t into poker, the gameplay won''t appeal to you



So overall it''s a pretty good game, I''ll give it a 8.5/10, it is cheap, you should try it out.'),
